rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"967"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-14T12:06:35-08:00","id":1158583,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RBAWintrow</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1158580#post1158580\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm the 470th backer. So many backers yet only 3 pages of discussion? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Well, 4 pages counting you. Many are probably still processing what we have read (I know I am). <br /> I like what I've seen in the manuscript so far and am excited to see more (Kith blessing was a fun surprise). <br /> <br /> Are we getting glimpse for Dreaming Roads later in campaign? Really looking forward to see how Dreams and Dreamshaping works.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12082,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12082-weird","user":"Weird","date":". 11-14-2017, 03:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12082-weird","name":"Weird","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12082_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-14T12:09:22-08:00","id":1158585,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div clas