le=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-14T16:06:05-08:00","id":1158687,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1158683#post1158683\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">.... Given beasts have Grim as a nickname, I'm guessing the Grim seeming has been retconned out of existence?</div> </div> </div> </div>Or perhaps they might have gotten assimilated into the Beast seeming?<br /> <br /> ...I have no idea how that would have panned out in practice but it's an idea.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-14T16:12:20-08:00","id":1158688,"title":"","content":"So we are funded \ud83d\ude01<br /> <br /> <br /> And just to add something to the discussion. I dont have the same level of insight as some of you to into previous projects or what have happened in development. But what I do know is what I liked about games like Vampire the Requiem 2nd edition, and that was that everything in both fluff and rules sort of represented what is what like being a vampire, which made it easy to run a game with every type of player, both the player who want to count the dots on the sheet, and the ones who creates sheets for just her backstory. And when I read Changeling 2nd I get the same feeling, everything seems geared towards what it's like being one of the lost. Quality over quantity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12759-sleepy","name":"Sleepy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-14T16:12:49-08:00","id":1158689,"title":"","content":"There's a lot of &quot;demonstrate by example&quot; in these early chapters, which isn't necessarily a bad thing but I'm hoping at least in character creation has some discrete elevator pitches for the various x and y splats.<br /> <br /> The new seemings seem pretty solid across the board, in that each has some real potential for story impact. I think the most worrisome of the bunch is actually the Wizened blessing, as (assuming the Build Equipment action is as in the corebook) its the one blessing that requires you to have a specific dice pool in order to function. While the crafter wizened will always be a cherished archetype, I think the soldier and chirurgeon kith's may have a bit more of struggle to use their blessing than most other changelings. (Ogres have this problem to lesser degree but presumably the blessing applies equally to sorcerous blasts as it does fists or firearms). The rest of the Seeming blessings just work (most of the time.)<br /> <br /> The short kith list is a bit worrisome, particularly as the list is by no means all-encompassing (though there are some neat surprises there.) Ultimately final judgement in that regard is reserved until we see how robust the rules for creating your own is. If I can throw together some new kiths without having to really fret about game balance, I can wait for a kithbook.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/526-schizopop","name":"schizoPOP","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"108"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-14T16:14:09-08:00","id":1158690,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rose Bailey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1158679#post1158679\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Actually, you know what, I have something I want to clarify.</div> </div> </div> </div>For a long time now, I haven't felt terribly excited by any games I've purchased. I haven't<i> hated </i>anything-- I like to think I can recognize and appreciate good craftsmanship, and I've operated based on that appreciation. But up until now, nothing's really grabbed me and spoken to me, the way I could swear games used to when I was younger. At a certain point, I started to assume that maybe this is how my life with games would be: intellectually intrigued enough to continue, but more or less emotionally impoverished.<br /> <br /> After I backed this Kickstarter and read the first two chapters, I can say that's changed. It's not much, but I feel some of the old spark coming back, and maybe-- maybe, maybe--- winter melting away.<br /> <br /> So thank you, Rose. One person very much appreciates what you do. I look forward to the next updates.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13580-hsienfan","name":"Hsienfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13580_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-14T16:19:18-08:00","id":1158693,"title":"","content":"Finished reading the seemings, not really liking the writing style so far. It just seems to obfuscate everything for me by having everything be flowery examples rather than an actual description.<br /> <br /> <b>Edit</b>: Chapter two having so many little patches of narrative examples.... yeah don't think this book is for me. Really hope this doesn't end up being the style new 2e books are presented in.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":8331,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","user":"milo v3","date":". 11-14-2017, 07:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-14T16:38:18-08:00","id":1158700,"title":"","content":"So 50 minutes after funding and we are well over a third of the way to the first stretch goal. Good times.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-14T16:46:48-08:00","id":1158702,"title":"","content":"Funded!! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1158683#post1158683\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">.... Given beasts have Grim as a nickname, I'm guessing the Grim seeming has been retconned out of existence?</div> </div> </div> </div>That seeming is the Grimm seeming. As in, Grimm's fairy tales. The Beasts are nicknamed Grims after the fairy spirits of English folklore that sometimes guard churches and appear as black dogs or other animals. I hope this clears things up for you!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Meghan Fitzgerald | Onyx Path freelance writer &amp; developer</i><br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\"><i>Changeling: The Lost developer</i></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#009999\"><i>Mage: The Awakening developer</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2229-meghan-fitzgerald","name":"Meghan Fitzgerald","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2229_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"124"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-14T17:01:06-08:00","id":1158706,"title":"","content":"hhooray! we're funded. and I must say Ogre's resonate with me on a level where if I should ever play in a game that's the first character I'm gonna try. <br /> <br /> also just started into the court section and while I'm sure I'll find something I like in all of them Spring is rather lovely really.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12235-emmens","name":"emmens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12235_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"51"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-14T17:02:19-08:00","id":1158707,"title":"","content":"So excited!!!! It is awesome how fast the kickstarter was funded! Bodes well for future 2nd edition CoD kickstarters I'd say <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />. Been devouring the Manuscript preview and am loving it!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12074-robert-d","name":"Robert D","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-14T17:03:29-08:00","id":1158708,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1158700#post1158700\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So 50 minutes after funding and we are well over a third of the way to the first stretch goal. Good times.</div> </div> </div> </div>...and now we're halfway through. That was fast.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-14T17:17:08-08:00","id":1158713,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1158708#post1158708\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> ...and now we're halfway through. That was fast.</div> </div> </div> </div>61% now. It would be cool to knock off all three stretch goals in the first 24 hours.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-14T17:27:52-08:00","id":1158717,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rose Bailey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1158679#post1158679\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Actually, you know what, I have something I want to clarify.<br /> <br /> You &quot;know OP is a business.&quot; Your conclusion is that that's why we made a game you don't like.<br /> <br /> Onyx Path is indeed a business. It sells games, and employs me to make those games for people.<br /> <br /> But... y'know... I'm also me. I'm not a business. I'm Rose, a girl who got the drafts of this game's first edition when she was working in a moldy basement trying to recover from her own durance. <i>Changeling </i>is as important to me as it is to anyone here. It told me my pain was real and that there was life past it. It was <i>magical</i>, in the most beautiful and most frightening senses of that word. It made me feel, to borrow another writer on the project's words, <i>feel seen</i>.<br /> <br /> <i>Changeling </i>was a big part of why I took the chance on applying for a job at the original White Wolf. A while later, it was the backdrop for the longest, best, and most intimate game I ever played in. <i>Changeling</i> has been here for me at the weirdest times, as I've walked between seasons much the way we all do.<br /> <br /> If you don't like the version of the game I worked on, then okay. I've been doing this a long time now, I know that not everything I do resonates with every potential player. But don't pull out that &quot;business&quot; talk. Don't talk like I (and the other creators) didn't put our hearts into this game for very personal reasons. That we don't <i>care</i>.<br /> <br /> I'm not a business. I'm a creator. So's everyone who contributed to this game. I, and we, love this game and what it can be as much as you or anyone else. As much as anyone <i>can</i>. Truly. Deeply. <i>Madly</i>. Please try to respect that.</div> </div> </div> </div>And.. I want to clarify too, Rose, since this came up. It's actually at the root of my main concern.<br /> <br /> I'm not judging your work. I can't, because I can't see it. &quot;Pay $5 and see, then retract if you don't like it&quot; might seem like an easy thing to ask, but in my circumstances it actually <i>isn't</i>. The whyfors of that aren't anything relevant to this.<br /> <br /> When <i>Beast </i>was on Kickstarter, there was text posted up to see and judge. This time there isn't, and that is my main issue. Hearing there's only a handful of Kiths in the Core worries me, but that's not an artistic judgment - personally, I loved the extended write-ups from <i>Winter Masques </i>back in the day so I'm not at all opposed to the format, quite the opposite in fact! - but it does seem like that's a bit light on what, to me at least,is a rather integral part of the game.<br /> <br /> So, by the way the Kickstarter has been done this time around,I honestly <i>can't </i>get a good read on the changes made to the &quot;Lost 2e&quot; I had become familiar with. All I can judge is the way this has been handled, and without knowing why it <i>was </i>handled that way at that. That's what I mean by 'business decision' - I'm sure there is some loss by those who just downloaded the previews before and then decided not to get the actual book. I get that cutting that risk makes sound business sense.<br /> <br /> Thus, and apologies if I gave offense without intending it (Gods know, I seem bad for that). My issue has precisely nothing to do with the work done on the new take of Lost 2e - aside, again, the apparent small amount of Kiths available upfront. It's that these substantial changes aren't being shown up-front so I <i>can </i>judge, which seems like a business-focused choice, please correct me if I'm wrong here?<br /> <br /> [As far as your work goes, <i>personally</i>? Huge fan - Requiem 2E is my favorite take on Vamp <i>ever</i>]<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11533-bluegrass-beast","name":"Bluegrass Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-14T17:47:45-08:00","id":1158723,"title":"","content":"After a quick read through, it seems like a decent successor to 1ed Lost. It has very much the same feel and considering how much I've loved and played that game, that's a good thing. The only things that have disappointed me so far is the new emphasis on Spring sexcapades. I always found it obnoxious in 1ed when players would always interprete Spring's desire as 'seduce everything whether it moves or not' and 2ed has emphasized that aspect of desire even more than 1ed did. It's not horrible from a purely textual point of view but in practice it's going to mean not playing the game with those people- which may mean not playing the game at all unfortunately. Then, as others have mentioned, the kith section is deeply disappointing in terms of its selection. Only 12? Each kith is VERY wordy and could easily have their word count cut in half and instead double the number of kiths we have available. Helldiver seems neat. The Siren Song power is as obnoxious as the 1ed merit was but is now free instead of costing merit dots. Notary kith's Abatement power seems exceptionally underpowered to the point of uselessness. On the other hand, the Hedge section was nice and the additions of the Dreaming Roads and Halls of Mirrors are intriguing even while the Hedge itself is comfortably familiar. I hope those get more fleshing out later in the book instead of being short throw-away paragraphs. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10769-llegume","name":"LLegume","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"94"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-14T17:58:48-08:00","id":1158728,"title":"","content":"found out as i was leaving my office today that this game was up on kickstarter. delighted to learn that it had already funded and pledged a hundo. <br /> <br /> going through the preview and i am super excited. i haven't made much time for roleplaying games in my life lately, been too focused on chasing paper. silicon valley is hella expensive and going hard on weekends is rough on the bank account. <br /> <br /> but this game. this game makes me want to call in the old squad of over the hill misfits turned respectable. they said that if i ever decided to run another game, that they would make rooms in their schedules for at least 3 hour session a week. the last time any of us gamed was 2011. <br /> <br /> six years. and the last game i ran for them was changeling: the lost 1e. <br /> <br /> thank you for this, changeling: the lost creative team. <br /> <br /> oh, and will there be like ... a extra special version of this book released? like &quot;deluxe&quot;? asking for a friend.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1996-firefly-night","name":"Firefly Night","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"150"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-14T18:24:36-08:00","id":1158733,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sleepy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1158688#post1158688\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But what I do know is what I liked about games like Vampire the Requiem 2nd edition, and that was that everything in both fluff and rules sort of represented what is what like being a vampire, which made it easy to run a game with every type of player, both the player who want to count the dots on the sheet, and the ones who creates sheets for just her backstory. And when I read Changeling 2nd I get the same feeling, everything seems geared towards what it's like being one of the lost. Quality over quantity.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm glad you like that! One of my main interests in writing and playing these games is experiencing lives I can relate to, but which are made different by the presence of the supernatural. I like getting into speculative experience, and I want the books to be very vivid and up-front about what it's like to be a changeling or a vampire. And focusing books on that is, I hope, very practical, because it lets you know what the game is like to play.<br /> <br /> (I have quite extensive thoughts on the relationship between empathy and horror, and my contributions to CtL2 are very much informed by them.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-14T18:46:49-08:00","id":1158738,"title":"","content":"And there is one stretch goal down!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-14T18:55:37-08:00","id":1158740,"title":"","content":"Ok, the hype does indeed appear to be real.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-14T19:36:05-08:00","id":1158749,"title":"","content":"Rose, there will be in the future some update of the seeming, court and contract rules from Dark Eras to make them compatible with final rules? It shouldn't need to be in a book, a blog post would be enough.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>LAND OF THE DAMNED: SPAIN (Spanish): </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/3MHWYm\" target=\"_blank\">Land of the Damned: Spain</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/52b0TX\" target=\"_blank\">Kingdoms of Blood: Spain</a>; Cities of the Damned: <a href=\"https://goo.gl/XFMSSe\" target=\"_blank\">Barcelona</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/AXxdgq\" target=\"_blank\">Valencia</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/zkI5a1\" target=\"_blank\">Carthian Constitution</a> (1812), <a href=\"https://goo.gl/5H8M4s\" target=\"_blank\">Three Arrows Pact</a>: <br /> <br /> <b>OTHERS (Spanish): </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/36HngB\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: The Redemption</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/6B9V8l\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Forgotten</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/247-uxas","name":"Uxas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar247_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-14T19:53:27-08:00","id":1158752,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uxas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1158749#post1158749\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Rose, there will be in the future some update of the seeming, court and contract rules from Dark Eras to make them compatible with final rules? It shouldn't need to be in a book, a blog post would be enough.</div> </div> </div> </div>This would make me very happy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-14T20:40:23-08:00","id":1158757,"title":"","content":"So, an observation. In less than 12 hours, Changeling 2e has raised more money than the entirety of Dark Eras 2. Part of that is because we have at least part of the manuscript this time around, we know the entire text is completed, so more people are willing to back the project. I think the other important observation is the power of anticipation. With DE2, the turnaround was so fast between when we found out that planning had started to the kickstarter launching that no anticipation was able to build up. On top of that, the first dark eras kickstarter had only just completed, where as for changeling it has being while. Plus, changeling already has an image in the ticker on the main page, something DE2 never got. <br /> <br /> Now, I'm not suggesting that all that we should wait another five years before having another Dark Eras kickstarter. I'm just hoping that the message that this kickstarter gives about dark eras isn't that they aren't profitable, but that next time it might need some time to sink in before the kickstarter launches. I absolutely adore those books, and I'm hoping that Dark Eras 3 is still in the cards somewhere after the dark shards project gets released. Only time will tell.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-14T21:05:32-08:00","id":1158761,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1158757#post1158757\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, an observation. In less than 12 hours, Changeling 2e has raised more money than the entirety of Dark Eras 2. Part of that is because we have at least part of the manuscript this time around, we know the entire text is completed, so more people are willing to back the project. I think the other important observation is the power of anticipation. With DE2, the turnaround was so fast between when we found out that planning had started to the kickstarter launching that no anticipation was able to build up. On top of that, the first dark eras kickstarter had only just completed, where as for changeling it has being while. Plus, changeling already has an image in the ticker on the main page, something DE2 never got.<br /> <br /> Now, I'm not suggesting that all that we should wait another five years before having another Dark Eras kickstarter. I'm just hoping that the message that this kickstarter gives about dark eras isn't that they aren't profitable, but that next time it might need some time to sink in before the kickstarter launches. I absolutely adore those books, and I'm hoping that Dark Eras 3 is still in the cards somewhere after the dark shards project gets released. Only time will tell.</div> </div> </div> </div>There is a necessary qualifier to keep in mind here: Changeling is <i>fucking popular</i>.<br /> <br /> That said, this message is still correct.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-14T21:08:50-08:00","id":1158762,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1158761#post1158761\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There is a necessary qualifier to keep in mind here: Changeling is <i>fucking popular</i>.<br /> <br /> That said, this message is still correct.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, there is totally that too! And crossovers are much less popular. All of that still points to my same thesis though... please don't give up on Dark Eras just based on a straight number crunch of these two kickstarters. <br /> <br /> On that note, $575 to the next stretch goal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-14T21:27:41-08:00","id":1158764,"title":"","content":"BAM. Stretch Goal 2","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12235-emmens","name":"emmens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12235_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"51"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-14T21:30:02-08:00","id":1158765,"title":"","content":"Also, new stretch goal at $88,000 for &quot;rules, suggestions, and further discussion&quot; on Freeholds for the Changeling Companion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-14T21:42:20-08:00","id":1158769,"title":"","content":"I strongly desire that","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12235-emmens","name":"emmens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12235_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"51"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-14T22:10:19-08:00","id":1158774,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MrParaduo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1158626#post1158626\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What was the curse again? I can't find the preview.</div> </div> </div> </div>They suffer Clarity damage if an ally is hurt by their schemes.<br /> <br /> In other words, a Fairest who acts like a Keeper quickly starts going as mad as one. On the other hand, they could just not trust anyone, but that's hardly a way to live...<br /> <br /> Also, I just realized Mirror Men are apparently a major thing. Am I correct in assuming they are a major faction of hobgoblin, maybe a reason changelings hide themselves? Sounds like they may spawn from mortals affected by Lost magic that hurts their Integrity.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-14T22:43:22-08:00","id":1158780,"title":"","content":"Something else I like about the Fairest is that while their bonus makes them great as support characters, a Fairest could actually contract (if you'll pardon the pun) her power to improve a particular person's efforts, bolstering them with her own willpower. Naturally you'd not want to do this to your own motley, but that could do quite well for mercenary work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T00:56:05-08:00","id":1158806,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2\" data-vbnamecard=\"2\">Rose Bailey</a> Might I make a small suggestion. For the Spring Court's Give and Take; rather than requiring the Keeper or it's minion to desire the Changeling, make it so that the Changeling must desire the Keeper or it's minion.<br /> <br /> As it stands there's nothing that forces the antagonists to play to Spring's strengths, the Keeper either cannot attack, or it can and is free to do so in any way. This reversal will force the antagonists to use social combat as they disguise themselves as someone harmless and try to stoke the Changeling's desires. If Spring uses their social-fu to see through the ruse they're safe or may get a free first blow.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T01:37:37-08:00","id":1158814,"title":"","content":"So, I just pledged 50 $ to support the Kickstarter and get my hardcover version. However, I was wondering why I didn't need to give a shipping adress? This is my first Kickstarter, so I may just have missed something but I suppose that OPP would need a shipping adress to actually ship a hardcover version of the book.<br /> <br /> Can someone help me here? I just want to make sure I actually get my book eventually because 50 $ + 20 $ shipping is a lot of money.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Never mind, apparently kickstarter doesn't accept my credit card for some unknown reason. Guess I can't actually pledge anything. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":8604,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8604-dragotarify","user":"Dragotarify","date":". 11-15-2017, 04:41 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8604-dragotarify","name":"Dragotarify","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T02:02:01-08:00","id":1158821,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dragotarify</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1158814#post1158814\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, I just pledged 50 $ to support the Kickstarter and get my hardcover version. However, I was wondering why I didn't need to give a shipping adress? This is my first Kickstarter, so I may just have missed something but I suppose that OPP would need a shipping adress to actually ship a hardcover version of the book.</div> </div> </div> </div>You give Shipping Address at the KS end, when you confirm your Pledge and money are to move to OPP. <b>RichT</b> will send you nice poll to ask about your address and confirm what you will want to get, in the end.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dragotarify</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1158814#post1158814\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can someone help me here? I just want to make sure I actually get my book eventually because 50 $ + 20 $ shipping is a lot of money.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bAsk <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar5_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"5\" data-vbnamecard=\"5\">RichT</a>, as he is KS manager of OPP and will know all the detail.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dragotarify</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1158814#post1158814\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">EDIT: Never mind, apparently kickstarter doesn't accept my credit card for some unknown reason. Guess I can't actually pledge anything. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Check if you card do not have set transactions limits on Internet shopping. If yes, change them to be <b>not</b> 0$ on those sums, best circa 100$ if you support over 50$.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T02:19:09-08:00","id":1158826,"title":"","content":"The Book of Kiths should be a possible add on for those going strictly digital, I live in Canada and I don't want to get brutalized by both the shipping and exchange rate for going physical copy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T03:26:17-08:00","id":1158844,"title":"","content":"Hey I know this is going back in time some...but...<br /> Just wanted to say to I've liked what I have seen so far. Seemings are very well done, I like that my Ogre can now talk about his past and see a therapist without risking clarity breaks. I do have a few concerns, but I'm not sure how to voice them without giving away spoilers to those who don't put down the $5 pledge. While I am sorry none of the kiths I wanted to play are in the core book, since you are providing rules to make them I should be able to reverse engineer them. So my razor hands assassin will take a bit of reverse engineering, but that won't be that hard. Probably some use of brawl for the skill, the power would probably be all unarmed attacks do +0 lethal damage, spend 1 glamour and damage becomes wyrd.<br /> <br /> Though that was something I noticed. None of the Kith abilities scaled during the game. Meaning that Kith Abilities start to become less important over scaling supernatural gifts (contracts) over the course of game play, possibly even becoming an after thought after wyrd 3 or 4. Am I missing something here?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T03:53:14-08:00","id":1158860,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HaplessWithDice</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1158844#post1158844\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Though that was something I noticed. None of the Kith abilities scaled during the game. Meaning that Kith Abilities start to become less important over scaling supernatural gifts (contracts) over the course of game play, possibly even becoming an after thought after wyrd 3 or 4. Am I missing something here?</div> </div> </div> </div>Something I noticed as well. Same is true for most Seeming Blessings (in case of which you may justify it as avoiding giving True Fae too much headstart). <br /> I think it'd be nice if character starting blessings would scale at least a little to give some extra utility, if not with Wyrd then by... maybe Court Mantle?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12082-weird","name":"Weird","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12082_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T03:54:38-08:00","id":1158861,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Meghan Fitzgerald</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1158702#post1158702\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That seeming is the Grimm seeming. As in, Grimm's fairy tales. The Beasts are nicknamed Grims after the fairy spirits of English folklore that sometimes guard churches and appear as black dogs or other animals. I hope this clears things up for you!</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2229-meghan-fitzgerald\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2229_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2229\" data-vbnamecard=\"2229\">Meghan Fitzgerald</a> , so maybe better would be changing Beasts nickname to something other? I feel as rather literate in English litrature trops and slightly in folklore - and even I did not know Grims names from tales. And when <b>CtL</b> 2e corebook in Introduction mentions Grimm's Fairy Tales as one of main inspirations - people <i>are</i> gone mistake Grims for... Grimms.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 11-15-2017, 06:58 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T03:58:55-08:00","id":1158863,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the help, Wyrd! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1158821#post1158821\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Check if you card do not have set transactions limits on Internet shopping. If yes, change them to be <b>not</b> 0$ on those sums, best circa 100$ if you support over 50$.</div> </div> </div> </div>I've found the problem. I need to wait till my limit resets, I dont have enough space for the pledge I was making. So I can make my pledge in ~2 weeks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8604-dragotarify","name":"Dragotarify","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T04:00:40-08:00","id":1158864,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1158806#post1158806\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> Might I make a small suggestion. For the Spring Court's Give and Take; rather than requiring the Keeper or it's minion to desire the Changeling, make it so that the Changeling must desire the Keeper or it's minion.<br /> <br /> As it stands there's nothing that forces the antagonists to play to Spring's strengths, the Keeper either cannot attack, or it can and is free to do so in any way. This reversal will force the antagonists to use social combat as they disguise themselves as someone harmless and try to stoke the Changeling's desires. If Spring uses their social-fu to see through the ruse they're safe or may get a free first blow.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's pretty brilliant actually.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13733-betterworldz","name":"BetterWorldz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13733_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T04:08:14-08:00","id":1158865,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BetterWorldz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1158864#post1158864\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's pretty brilliant actually.</div> </div> </div> </div> I agree, that might work better.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T04:15:46-08:00","id":1158870,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Weird</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1158860#post1158860\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Something I noticed as well. Same is true for most Seeming Blessings (in case of which you may justify it as avoiding giving True Fae too much headstart). <br /> I think it'd be nice if character starting blessings would scale at least a little to give some extra utility, if not with Wyrd then by... maybe Court Mantle?</div> </div> </div> </div> Yeah Wyrd should buff both Seeming Blessings and Kith Blessings, it's odd it doesn't. <br /> <br /> Like maybe the Darklings blessing lasts 3+ Wyrd for duration.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T04:21:37-08:00","id":1158871,"title":"","content":"So far I like the Helldiver and Notary as new kiths, we thought the Helldiver was the new version of the miner, nope, the Helldiver is far weirder, like a deep sea diver for weirder places like twilight, the shadow (first type of changeling to have any kind of connection to the shadow), Underworld, Astral Plane, perhaps weirder places like Supernal Eminations.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T04:28:29-08:00","id":1158872,"title":"","content":"Hunterheart is bad ass, good at tracking other Far and not only can cause Insenate Condition or Frightened with a look, but also deal unarmed lethal damage (should add +1 damage if Beast because the beasts own lethal damage seems redondant as a Hunterheart).<br /> <br /> I'm thinking of raising my idea of my Darkling Hunterheart Cenobite, who now hunts his as darkess, screams, and moans of taboo unnatural pleasures.<br /> <br /> I'll add insensate condition (tilt) includes pleasure, so the Hunterheart can have that sort of animal magnetism going on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T04:33:01-08:00","id":1158873,"title":"","content":"I want to know who wrote the script for the kickstarter video. Whoever it is got my attention. I was not really interested in changeling before but now oooo now I need this second edition so I can pour over every line of this book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T05:01:45-08:00","id":1158882,"title":"","content":"I really hope we get the Book of Kiths, but seeing how fast this was funded I have good hope <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10272-daigotsu-max","name":"Daigotsu Max","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T05:07:30-08:00","id":1158888,"title":"","content":"To be clear, regardless of the kickstarter we're getting Book of Kiths right? The stretch goal is just for adding Crown stuff to the book (which sounds really odd to me since I don't really see how that category of Regalia really has anything to do with the Kiths)?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T05:26:33-08:00","id":1158895,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1158888#post1158888\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To be clear, regardless of the kickstarter we're getting Book of Kiths right? The stretch goal is just for adding Crown stuff to the book (which sounds really odd to me since I don't really see how that category of Regalia really has anything to do with the Kiths)?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah I noticed it too; Quite puzzling.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12082-weird","name":"Weird","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12082_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T06:33:03-08:00","id":1158917,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rose Bailey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1158560#post1158560\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hedge-enchanted items, or tokens, have powers based on how long they were in the Hedge. Here's an example:</div> </div> </div> </div>I see, sound pretty interesting. Question though. Are court (contract wise) gonna function like the Hill preview? They get 1 contract of Emotion, generic and talespinning? With the first being generic effects and i can fill them with whatever emotion my court is about. The second with any Contract that fit. Or its gonna be like 1st with each court having special unique contracts.<br /> <br /> I dont know if this preview material or not but are Huntsman have the kind of focus than in Hills previews? Tied to how the changeling society works? Or are they like Strix/Idigams in that i can pretend they never exist and little would change from the setting?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2179-lokiravenspeak","name":"LokiRavenSpeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T06:39:53-08:00","id":1158918,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Weird</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1158895#post1158895\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah I noticed it too; Quite puzzling.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> The Regalia bit has me quite confused as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10272-daigotsu-max","name":"Daigotsu Max","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T06:47:10-08:00","id":1158920,"title":"","content":"Third Stretch goal reached!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12082-weird","name":"Weird","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12082_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T06:50:24-08:00","id":1158922,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Daigotsu Max</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1158918#post1158918\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> The Regalia bit has me quite confused as well.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh that's old story. Basically we have six collections of Arcadian Contracts connected by theme/purpose called Regalia. Each Seeming learns Contracts of one Regalia easier than others.<br /> How they are connected to Kiths is anyone's guess. Maybe something to do with Old Vainglory? I hope not since it would probably mean removal of &quot;Dropping the Mask.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12082-weird","name":"Weird","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12082_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T07:19:01-08:00","id":1158932,"title":"","content":"I think it's more just symbolic connection, Kiths with a theme that relates to say the Crown Reglia's themes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T07:27:59-08:00","id":1158936,"title":"","content":"So long as there's a damsel in distress kith I'm happy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T08:44:17-08:00","id":1158963,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1158806#post1158806\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As it stands there's nothing that forces the antagonists to play to Spring's strengths, the Keeper either cannot attack, or it can and is free to do so in any way.</div> </div> </div> </div>Spring doesn't last forever.<br /> <br /> Also, I feel as though a court built on desire is going to have its work cut out for it avoiding entanglement with the heart's desires of the fae whose interests connect to that specific bunch of changelings \u2014 the Gentry send obsessed suitors and jealous dragons and heist teams on the last job they'll ever need to take, which funnels the range of offense down to a very social-savvy-dependent class of evasion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T09:05:45-08:00","id":1158971,"title":"","content":"I had a follow up thought on Settings, the Scheherazade (Toronto) Freehold Setting has complexity and depth, it'd be perfect for a type of book like Necropolis: Rio was for Mummy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2241,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","user":"Omegaphallic","date":". 11-15-2017, 01:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T09:11:28-08:00","id":1158975,"title":"","content":"Has anybody seen the book plate that's a pledge goal?<br /> On an unrelated note, anybody know what a book plate is?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12885-e11even-e11even","name":"E11even-E11even","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12885_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T09:16:16-08:00","id":1158979,"title":"","content":"Another 13K until we hit the last stretch goal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T09:30:32-08:00","id":1158989,"title":"","content":"Concerning the kiths, i dont really mind the small number (espacially since we are supposed to be given the mechanics to create more and another book entirely on kiths).<br /> <br /> But my questions here is that in your opinions, in regards to kith, can the corebook stand on its own? Are the kiths presented each distinct enough from the other to give a varied list?<br /> Reading the kith i cant help but get the feeling that it is incomplete. Like you would need the extra book of kith to run an interesting game. (Please understand, this is just a feeling based on first impression from reading the manuscript. It is likely to change upon receiving more information on the book and even from rereading it after a week. )<br /> <br /> Personnaly, i would shorten each kiths description to add more kiths. My players never had a problem with the short descriptions in 1st ed. Then with the book of kiths you can revisit the kiths of the core with deeper more thorough descriptions.<br /> <br /> (I dont mean anything to be taken as a criticism of the effort put into the project. Everything i read so far shows that it is clearly a work of passion and love and i have full confidence that i will be happy with the end product.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Completed campaign: Scion 2nd Edition. Les L\u00e9gendes Currently playing: Being a dad for a 3 year old daughter and a 2 years old son and now a beautiful new baby.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11312-maitrecorbo","name":"Maitrecorbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11312_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"719"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T09:33:56-08:00","id":1158995,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1158979#post1158979\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Another 13K until we hit the last stretch goal.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm sure its not going to stay the last one for very long<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T09:41:23-08:00","id":1158999,"title":"","content":"When I first saw that there were only 12 kiths, I was sorely disappointed. <br /> Then I read the rules, and the consistency of power between them. <br /> I loved it. <br /> One of the things that really bothered me with the Underhill preview was the lack of internal balance; some kiths were simply better, no questions asked. <br /> With the current, more structured system that has been fixed, and with a solid framework for how they are handled, mechanically, I'm really excited to get my hands on the full rules!<br /> <br /> The only thing bothering me still is the lack of rules for flying, swimming, or burrowing kiths. I would have loved a precedent on how to go about making something like that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":585,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/585-seidmadr","user":"Seidmadr","date":".  autocorrect errors 11-15-2017, 12:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/585-seidmadr","name":"Seidmadr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar585_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T09:56:06-08:00","id":1159008,"title":"","content":"I get the feeling we'll probably get the new stretch goal by days end.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12235-emmens","name":"emmens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12235_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"51"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T09:59:20-08:00","id":1159011,"title":"","content":"Why does everyone call the old previews by &quot;Underhill&quot;? Isn't his surname simply &quot;Hill&quot;?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T09:59:21-08:00","id":1159012,"title":"","content":"People keep saying 12 kiths. Do we know those are the only core kiths, or we assuming that some weren't cut from the preview?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T10:05:21-08:00","id":1159019,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>reseru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159011#post1159011\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why does everyone call the old previews by &amp;quot;Underhill&amp;quot;? Isn't his surname simply &amp;quot;Hill&amp;quot;?</div> </div> </div> </div>It's a shortened way of saying &quot;the version we were getting under David Hill.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T10:06:54-08:00","id":1159024,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>reseru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159011#post1159011\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why does everyone call the old previews by &quot;Underhill&quot;? Isn't his surname simply &quot;Hill&quot;?</div> </div> </div> </div>If memory serves correct...<br /> <br /> Started as a typo when someone forgot to put a space between &quot;under&quot; and &quot;Hill&quot;. Then it kind of caught on from there, since &quot;Underhill&quot; is a sort of whimsical-sounding term you'd hear in a fairy tale (and was the fake name Frodo used in LotR, which while not really being a fairy tale, was a fantastical epic) and thus a bit connected to Changeling.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T10:09:28-08:00","id":1159027,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159012#post1159012\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">People keep saying 12 kiths. Do we know those are the only core kiths, or we assuming that some weren't cut from the preview?</div> </div> </div> </div>Reasonably certain. The preview document says that we've got 12 same kiths, but that we're not limited to using those 12. I wouldn't be surprised if we got a 13th as an example in the kith creation section, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T10:10:02-08:00","id":1159028,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159012#post1159012\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">People keep saying 12 kiths. Do we know those are the only core kiths, or we assuming that some weren't cut from the preview?</div> </div> </div> </div>Rose can probably confirm that, but I do think I recall her saying that the entire book will be previews across the four weeks. That would preclude parts of the manuscript being redacted.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T10:19:16-08:00","id":1159033,"title":"","content":"Rose, I ask you as a creative mind. Is it completely impossible for a further stretch goal to include more kiths in the original core book? Is there a possible way, then instead of other ideas you guys have had, for all of our extra funding money go to more word count for More kiths? Because I can agree with the idea that more kiths is worth a lot. At this point, I think people would feel a lot more comfortable paying more money for more kiths in the core book, even just as a digital add-on. If there are kith creation rules later, I think that extra kiths seem to be more valuable than a sourcebook or supplement book on them. More people would be happy to pay extra just to make sure that the current kith system portrays more, and to not worry if their homebrew version of their kith contradicts Canon. It almost feels like changlings now have two z splats. Which isn't bad if rules are as intended and anyone doubting their kith should wait till they level up. But I'm sure you understand wh\u00e8e we are coming from creatively, and it's be much easier if Keith and entitlement are z splats rather than kith being a creative homebrewed x splat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":935,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","user":"Cleverest of Things","date":". 11-15-2017, 01:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T10:19:57-08:00","id":1159036,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159028#post1159028\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Rose can probably confirm that, but I do think I recall her saying that the entire book will be previews across the four weeks. That would preclude parts of the manuscript being redacted.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>White Oak Dragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159027#post1159027\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Reasonably certain. The preview document says that we've got 12 same rkiths, but that we're not limited to using those 12. I wouldn't be surprised if we got a 13th as an example in the kith creation section, though.</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay. Thank you for the answers. I appreciate it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T10:23:54-08:00","id":1159038,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>White Oak Dragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159019#post1159019\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's a shortened way of saying &quot;the version we were getting under David Hill.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>I assumed it was both that and an Undertale reference.<br /> <br /> ...To be honest, Undertale does feel like it could be a Durance under a Keeper whose realm explicitly operates under RPG rules.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T10:24:15-08:00","id":1159039,"title":"","content":"And if any kiths don't make it into the core book, the stretch goals have already reached the point of a Book of Kiths supplement<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12074-robert-d","name":"Robert D","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T10:32:05-08:00","id":1159048,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159039#post1159039\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And if any kiths don't make it into the core book, the stretch goals have already reached the point of a Book of Kiths supplement</div> </div> </div> </div>I think the problem there is that it isn't in core. Most CofD books put ideas that seem clearly how the world works into supplements. 2e is notorious for combining the...&quot;options&quot; that should be been there from the start into beginner baseline material. Things that should be said in the first book should be said in the first book. I can completely understand kith as a z splat, that a changeling should be a one <br /> Off with a solid x and y, and kith be a weird specific thing. If Kith is a weak z splat and entitlement is a strong z splat, hell yes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":935,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","user":"Cleverest of Things","date":".  Mobile is bizarre withou autocorrect. Serioisly. 11-15-2017, 01:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T11:08:44-08:00","id":1159069,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159038#post1159038\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I assumed it was both that and an Undertale reference.<br /> <br /> ...To be honest, Undertale does feel like it could be a Durance under a Keeper whose realm explicitly operates under RPG rules.</div> </div> </div> </div>Who is the Keeper though, Toriel or Azriel?<br /> <br /> Actually, a strong argument could be made that <i>the player</i> is the Keeper, and all of the monsters are Changelings. In fact the text kind of makes that argument if you reset after a pacifist ending.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T11:14:49-08:00","id":1159073,"title":"","content":"Speaking as someone who hasn\u2019t read the text yet, I actually kind of like the sound of there being a much smaller number of Kiths. When David first teased that Kith and Seeming would be separated, I assumed that would mean a much smaller number of Kiths, as many 1e Kiths from different Seemings would be combined, making the choice of Seeming a big differentiating factor between them. I figured we would likely get around 1/5 the number of Kiths that were in the 1e core. Over 100 Kiths was one of the few things about Underhill I didn\u2019t love.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T11:17:36-08:00","id":1159078,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1158963#post1158963\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Spring doesn't last forever.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not sure what your point is here.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1158963#post1158963\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, I feel as though a court built on desire is going to have its work cut out for it avoiding entanglement with the heart's desires of the fae whose interests connect to that specific bunch of changelings</div> </div> </div> </div>I see it differently. I never saw the Spring Court as slaves to their desires, but masters of their own desires.<br /> <br /> Spring is not the Court where you drink to excess and wake up with a roaring hangover. Spring is the court where you drink just the right amount and wake up full of fond memories. Spring is not the Court where you jump into bed with the nearest pretty face and feel lonely in her arms. Spring is the Court where you know exactly what you want and who you want it with and if he requires investment you use that desire to drive yourself to become a mastreo of romance or a wealthy enough to shower him with diamonds; whatever it takes because spring is the season to plant seeds not reap the harvest.<br /> <br /> And that is why the Spring court can avoid entanglements with the gentry and their servants. Mastering your desires means knowing exactly what you want, and what they want is not Arcadia.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T11:27:33-08:00","id":1159081,"title":"","content":"I have some general feedback. It's mixed, but it always will be in the first draft, and I'm still digging into it, so I'll likely find more stuff I like as time goes by.<br /> <br /> <b>Stuff I Like</b><br /> <br /> -That Bridge Burners now are targeting the things that lure the Gentry in, and, indeed, that those things <i>do</i> lure the Gentry in. Dreams, hope, creativity, etc., are now all dangerous. Bridge Burners being willing to cauterize the good parts of life to get rid of the painful ones is both a very understandable motivation and yet incredibly horrific. This dual aspect that all beauty also carries risk, even in mundane reality, plays really nicely into Changeling.<br /> <br /> -The Wyrd is now about balancing the equations of life, and it's that aspect of give <i>and</i> take that I like the most. While I've always sort of quibbled over Changeling 1e having a feeling of everything being out to take from you and give you little in return, the idea that the Wyrd always tries to <i>balance</i> things (not necessarily equally) does add the idea that, not only does every gain require a loss, but every loss will bring some measure of gain. It's a slightly hopeful note that I can see the Lost holding onto.<br /> <br /> -The Spring Courtier responding to a Huntsman with &quot;Do I know you?&quot; and it cutting like a knife, hot damn. The Seasonal Courts in general having a focus on why and how they keep the Gentry away is pretty great.<br /> <br /> -The structure of Kith Blessings are neat. Easier exceptionals are great.<br /> <br /> <b>Stuff I Don't Like</b><br /> <br /> -Seeming Blessings. There's a bunch of problems here, as far as I see it. I can't tell what narrative role they're meant to fulfill. Are they meant to be small little utility tricks that just let the players show off aesthetically, or are they supposed to embed them thoroughly into their role? Is this just a neat little trick, or is this a real power?<br /> <br /> There's also some unevenness as far as accessibility goes. A Darkling can evaporate into smoke, mist, a sunbeam, a shadow, whatever. But an Elemental can only move their element; something that usually isn't an issue for one aspected to earth or air, but what about water? Fire? What about non-traditional elements, like smoke? Electricity? Surprise?<br /> <br /> Likewise, there seemed to be some move towards more conceptual freedom that some of these abilities walk back. Wouldn't it be more appropriate for an Ogre to be able to inflict a Beaten Down Tilt via <i>social</i> actions too? Then you could play someone who verbally beats someone into submission with blunt words; as much the abuser and vicious shark of a creature as a violent brute, but they just bruise the heart, not the flesh.<br /> <br /> Also, while we're at it, as a matter of personal taste, something I liked was the idea of Changelings being able to empower themselves by acting like the Gentry; hungrily feeding off of induced emotions to fuel their powers like an emotional brush fire. That some of these abilities use Willpower but not others, ostensibly for balance reasons, feels like it hurts that feeling. But who knows? Maybe Changelings can regain WP by feeding, which would fix this.<br /> <br /> And can Darklings move while merged with an object? A bit unclear there.<br /> <br /> -And on the subject of Seemings... Is the Fairest Blessing doing the right thing mechanically? And the Beast one, for that matter? If a Seeming's Blessing is meant to represent the <i>feeling</i> of that Seeming, I feel like a power that helps others shine in the spotlight sort of bucks the trend for a Seeming that is all about being in the spotlight. And what do claws and speed have to do with a freedom that comes with instinct? It's neat and all, but... It's also sorta dull.<br /> <br /> -Kiths. Are they optional? The book is unclear if you choose one automatically. And can we get a bit more variety? Thus far, they're mostly social. I'd like a sneaky Kith or two, and I'm sure others might like a few more violent ones. Really, it feels like the limitations here are going to hurt the line, but I expect we'll get a bit more, so...<br /> <br /> -And on the topic of Kiths... Hunterhearts. Why not make their bonus to all tracking, not just fae tracking?<br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> I guess the summary is that, mechanically, I've got some worries, but I'm fairly happy with the direction of the fluff thus far. I'm going to reserve total judgement for the Hedge section, though, which will make or break my feelings on the line.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2855-axelgear","name":"Axelgear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2855_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1450"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T11:40:48-08:00","id":1159089,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159078#post1159078\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not sure what your point is here.</div> </div> </div> </div>Strangers who haven't got the means to negotiate Spring's Bargain simply <i>wait until Spring has passed.</i><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I see it differently. I never saw the Spring Court as slaves to their desires, but masters of their own desires. </div> </div> </div>That has nothing to do with my point, which has nothing to do with what Spring Courtiers want.<br /> <br /> My point is that when your power lies in making the mortal world a desirable place to be it is kind of hard to avoid the Gentry sending someone whose heart's desire lies within the freehold (whether naturally or through notionally peaceable maneuvering) to attack it.<br /> <br /> It's hard to honor the demands of Spring's Bargain without facilitating the holes that let the Strangers in, because powerful need is something the Strangers are equipped to engineer in their servants or steal from elsewhere.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T11:43:40-08:00","id":1159090,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cleverest of Things</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159033#post1159033\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Rose, I ask you as a creative mind. Is it completely impossible for a further stretch goal to include more kiths in the original core book? Is there a possible way, then instead of other ideas you guys have had, for all of our extra funding money go to more word count for More kiths? Because I can agree with the idea that more kiths is worth a lot. At this point, I think people would feel a lot more comfortable paying more money for more kiths in the core book, even just as a digital add-on. If there are kith creation rules later, I think that extra kiths seem to be more valuable than a sourcebook or supplement book on them. More people would be happy to pay extra just to make sure that the current kith system portrays more, and to not worry if their homebrew version of their kith contradicts Canon. It almost feels like changlings now have two z splats. Which isn't bad if rules are as intended and anyone doubting their kith should wait till they level up. But I'm sure you understand wh\u00e8e we are coming from creatively, and it's be much easier if Keith and entitlement are z splats rather than kith being a creative homebrewed x splat.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not Rose, but... We have a hard limit on how long a CofD corebook can be, because they're intended as working corebooks not prestige nostalgia editions like the WoD20 books. The longer a book gets, the more expensive it is for people to get a Print on Demand copy from Drivethru.<br /> <br /> Which is why CTL has a companion, and why you'll probably see &quot;companion&quot; type books from any kickstarters following this one; it's not that we want to be stingy, it's the economics of publishing. Add-on material getting added into the corebook makes life much harder for everyone.<br /> <br /> It would also slow the kickstarter's fulfilment down.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T11:46:23-08:00","id":1159093,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159078#post1159078\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I see it differently. I never saw the Spring Court as slaves to their desires, but masters of their own desires.<br /> <br /> Spring is not the Court where you drink to excess and wake up with a roaring hangover. Spring is the court where you drink just the right amount and wake up full of fond memories. Spring is not the Court where you jump into bed with the nearest pretty face and feel lonely in her arms. Spring is the Court where you know exactly what you want and who you want it with and if he requires investment you use that desire to drive yourself to become a mastreo of romance or a wealthy enough to shower him with diamonds; whatever it takes because spring is the season to plant seeds not reap the harvest.<br /> <br /> And that is why the Spring court can avoid entanglements with the gentry and their servants. Mastering your desires means knowing exactly what you want, and what they want is not Arcadia.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can concure with <b>Kings Raven</b> - only saying that Spring MASTERS THEIR Desires AND CONTROL others Desires. Just like any other Seasonal Court with their emotions, really:<ul><li>Summer masters their Wrath on Gentry into 'noble crusade' and control Wrath of others to feed on it.</li> <li>Autumn masters their Fear of Gentry to make it into magic obsession and control Fear of others to feed on it.</li> <li>Winter masters their Sorrow of what Gentry taken them and control Sorrow of other to feed on it.</li> </ul><br /> Seasonal Courts are not Black &amp; White - they all are responses to trauma BUT ALSO means to feed on emotions of others.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T11:52:53-08:00","id":1159095,"title":"","content":"I actually feel like saying that I really enjoy Fairest Blessing, it has strong &quot;Leader/Support player&quot; feel to me. My only beef with it is that it's next to useless to Gentry, since Willpower is so hard for them to accumulate and it's hard to imagine total egotists like them to wish to spend it on their minions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12082-weird","name":"Weird","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12082_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T12:02:04-08:00","id":1159101,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dave Brookshaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159090#post1159090\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Not Rose, but... We have a hard limit on how long a CofD corebook can be, because they're intended as working corebooks not prestige nostalgia editions like the WoD20 books. The longer a book gets, the more expensive it is for people to get a Print on Demand copy from Drivethru.<br /> <br /> Which is why CTL has a companion, and why you'll probably see &amp;quot;companion&amp;quot; type books from any kickstarters following this one; it's not that we want to be stingy, it's the economics of publishing. Add-on material getting added into the corebook makes life much harder for everyone.<br /> <br /> It would also slow the kickstarter's fulfilment down.</div> </div> </div> </div>Will companion books have physical print versions also?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12885-e11even-e11even","name":"E11even-E11even","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12885_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T12:13:17-08:00","id":1159109,"title":"","content":"On page 29 of thew preview it says Fairest get +1 to a Power stat. What stats are those? I thought stats are divided into Mental, Social and Physical.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11799-rbawintrow","name":"RBAWintrow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11799_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"68"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T12:14:43-08:00","id":1159110,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>reseru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159011#post1159011\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why does everyone call the old previews by &quot;Underhill&quot;? Isn't his surname simply &quot;Hill&quot;?</div> </div> </div> </div>In as much as I had a hand in coining it-It's the David Hill version, and it went under. Underhill is also, you know, fairy-tale-esque.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T12:15:43-08:00","id":1159112,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RBAWintrow</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159109#post1159109\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">On page 29 of thew preview it says Fairest get +1 to a Power stat. What stats are those? I thought stats are divided into Mental, Social and Physical.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Mental, Physical and Social skills each have one Power, Finesse and Resistance stat. <br /> For example, under Physical, Strength is your Power stat, Dexterity is your Finesse stat, and Stamina is your Resistance stat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12885-e11even-e11even","name":"E11even-E11even","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12885_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T12:17:05-08:00","id":1159113,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RBAWintrow</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159109#post1159109\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">On page 29 of thew preview it says Fairest get +1 to a Power stat. What stats are those? I thought stats are divided into Mental, Social and Physical.</div> </div> </div> </div>Attributes divide into a three-by-three grid of Mental-Social-Physical/Power-Finesse-Resistance. Power Attributes are Intelligence, Presence, and Strength, Finesse Attributes are Wits, Manipulation, and Dexterity, and Resistance Attributes are Resolve, Composure, and Stamina.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T12:19:34-08:00","id":1159117,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RBAWintrow</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159109#post1159109\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">On page 29 of thew preview it says Fairest get +1 to a Power stat. What stats are those? I thought stats are divided into Mental, Social and Physical.</div> </div> </div> </div>Strength, Intelligence, and Presence. The Power stats are the blunt force versions of Mental, Social, and Physical stats.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T12:22:45-08:00","id":1159119,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>E11even-E11even</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1158975#post1158975\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Has anybody seen the book plate that's a pledge goal?<br /> On an unrelated note, anybody know what a book plate is?</div> </div> </div> </div>It's a essentially a sticker you paste into the interior of a book, often with a place to note the name of the book's owner, though in this case it's with the authors' signatures.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T12:25:23-08:00","id":1159120,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yossarian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159119#post1159119\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's a essentially a sticker you paste into the interior of a book, often with a place to note the name of the book's owner, though in this case it's with the authors' signatures.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you for this. I was actually Lost\u2122 when I read about it. At first I imagined a literal food plate.<br /> <br /> Now if only we could figure out what Power stats are.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12885-e11even-e11even","name":"E11even-E11even","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12885_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T12:30:29-08:00","id":1159122,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>E11even-E11even</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159120#post1159120\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Now if only we could figure out what Power stats are.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159117#post1159117\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Strength, Intelligence, and Presence. The Power stats are the blunt force versions of Mental, Social, and Physical stats.</div> </div> </div> </div>Does this help?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12082,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12082-weird","user":"Weird","date":".  If I come off as two passive aggressive I'll just delete this. 11-15-2017, 03:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12082-weird","name":"Weird","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12082_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T12:48:53-08:00","id":1159127,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dave Brookshaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159090#post1159090\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Not Rose, but... We have a hard limit on how long a CofD corebook can be, because they're intended as working corebooks not prestige nostalgia editions like the WoD20 books. The longer a book gets, the more expensive it is for people to get a Print on Demand copy from Drivethru.<br /> <br /> Which is why CTL has a companion, and why you'll probably see &quot;companion&quot; type books from any kickstarters following this one; it's not that we want to be stingy, it's the economics of publishing. Add-on material getting added into the corebook makes life much harder for everyone.<br /> <br /> It would also slow the kickstarter's fulfilment down.</div> </div> </div> </div>So in other words...the page count has been set, and approved, and there's nothing that could be done to stop it barring any unusual circumstances and from the errata phase?<br /> <br /> (also I presume that's why the stretch goals thus far have said nothing about actually extending the existing corebook? )<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>E11even-E11even</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159101#post1159101\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Will companion books have physical print versions also?</div> </div> </div> </div>Will there be a physical print version period? Yeah, there should be.<br /> <br /> Will backers get the physical print version for free? No, that typically doesn't happen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T12:50:48-08:00","id":1159129,"title":"","content":"Thank you all for the explanation. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11799-rbawintrow","name":"RBAWintrow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11799_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"68"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T12:52:56-08:00","id":1159130,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maitrecorbo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1158989#post1158989\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Concerning the kiths, i dont really mind the small number (espacially since we are supposed to be given the mechanics to create more and another book entirely on kiths).<br /> <br /> But my questions here is that in your opinions, in regards to kith, can the corebook stand on its own? Are the kiths presented each distinct enough from the other to give a varied list?<br /> Reading the kith i cant help but get the feeling that it is incomplete. Like you would need the extra book of kith to run an interesting game. (Please understand, this is just a feeling based on first impression from reading the manuscript. It is likely to change upon receiving more information on the book and even from rereading it after a week. )<br /> <br /> Personnaly, i would shorten each kiths description to add more kiths. My players never had a problem with the short descriptions in 1st ed. Then with the book of kiths you can revisit the kiths of the core with deeper more thorough descriptions.<br /> <br /> (I dont mean anything to be taken as a criticism of the effort put into the project. Everything i read so far shows that it is clearly a work of passion and love and i have full confidence that i will be happy with the end product.)</div> </div> </div> </div> Agreed, 100%.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T12:53:38-08:00","id":1159131,"title":"","content":"Actually, that brings up something-I love how wide the Free Attribute spread is. It really emphasizes how flexible and chaotic changelings are, and opens up a bunch of character concepts. Want to be a beautiful Fairest brute? A stoic, focused Beast? A social butterfly Darkling? An Ogre sorcerer-warrior straight out of tian xia? You can!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T13:03:55-08:00","id":1159136,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>E11even-E11even</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159112#post1159112\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The Mental, Physical and Social skills each have one Power, Finesse and Resistance stat. <br /> For example, under Physical, Strength is your Power stat, Dexterity is your Finesse stat, and Stamina is your Resistance stat.</div> </div> </div> </div> Resistance stats Stamina (physical), Composer (Social), Resolve (mental). <br /> <br /> Power stats Strength (physical), Presence (Social), Intelligence (mental). <br /> <br /> Finesse stats Dexterity (physical), Manipulation (Social), Wits (mental) <br /> <br /> Darklings and Wizened can choose from Finesse for a bonus dot. <br /> <br /> Fairest and Orgers can chose from Power for their bonus dot. <br /> <br /> Beasts and Elementals can choose from the Resistance Stats for their bonus dot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T13:11:54-08:00","id":1159141,"title":"","content":"Under $10k to the next stretch goal...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T14:01:32-08:00","id":1159174,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159127#post1159127\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Will there be a physical print version period? Yeah, there should be.<br /> <br /> Will backers get the physical print version for free? No, that typically doesn't happen.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12885-e11even-e11even","name":"E11even-E11even","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12885_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T14:21:55-08:00","id":1159181,"title":"","content":"Backed the Kickstarter, downloaded the preview, read the first chapter. Changeling 1e was my favorite NWoD game (guess I'm not the only one), and the second edition might just become my favorite CofD game.<br /> <br /> I hope there will be more previews of the artwork along the way; that's a part of the book I'm really interested in. (I'm pretty sure that two players in a Changeling campaign I ran chose their kith - and maybe seeming - by looking at the art. A Darkling Mirrorskin and a Wizened Drudge - the second one was a bit of a surprise.)<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/204-arcane","name":"Arcane","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T14:29:43-08:00","id":1159189,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arcane</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159181#post1159181\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Backed the Kickstarter, downloaded the preview, read the first chapter. Changeling 1e was my favorite NWoD game (guess I'm not the only one), and the second edition might just become my favorite CofD game.<br /> <br /> I hope there will be more previews of the artwork along the way; that's a part of the book I'm really interested in. (I'm pretty sure that two players in a Changeling campaign I ran chose their kith - and maybe seeming - by looking at the art. A Darkling Mirrorskin and a Wizened Drudge - the second one was a bit of a surprise.)<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>We may get a couple more pieces, but I wouldn't hold out for too many. Most of the art won't be contracted until after the Kickstarter is completed. Kinda hard to preview something that doesn't exist yet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T14:41:45-08:00","id":1159194,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rose Bailey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1158543#post1158543\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The whole book will be in the backer previews. Those will be in the third week. We'll also do one or more settings as public previews. (Caveat on that, though -- I'm gonna want to lead with Tumbledown Market, which people who follow the blog have already seen. I'm just really in love with that one and want to share it with the larger KS update audience.)<br /> <br /> I think I mentioned this before, but the settings are:<ul><li><b>Eighty-Nine Dreams of Home</b>, Hong Kong (the Societies of Morning, Day, and Night)</li> <li><b>The Council of Elves</b>, Reykjavik (the four seasons, but not as you know them)</li> <li><b>Hard-a-Lee</b>, Massachusetts (the Courts of High Tide, Ebb Tide, Low Tide, and Flood Tide)</li> <li><b>Tumbledown Market</b>, New Orleans and other linked locations (the Courts of Coin, Barter, Favors, and Shady Deals)</li> </ul></div> </div> </div> </div>Are Signature Settings supplemental books?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12885-e11even-e11even","name":"E11even-E11even","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12885_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T14:57:04-08:00","id":1159207,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>E11even-E11even</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159194#post1159194\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Are Signature Settings supplemental books?</div> </div> </div> </div>No. These are the example settings commonly found in the back of the corebooks of other CofD gamelines.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T15:09:05-08:00","id":1159212,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159189#post1159189\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We may get a couple more pieces, but I wouldn't hold out for too many. Most of the art won't be contracted until after the Kickstarter is completed. Kinda hard to preview something that doesn't exist yet.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, you need something to fill those months between the end of the Kickstarter and the first*.pdf. (And I know why I hope instead of expect.) <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/204-arcane","name":"Arcane","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T15:12:11-08:00","id":1159215,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159207#post1159207\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> No. These are the example settings commonly found in the back of the corebooks of other CofD gamelines.</div> </div> </div> </div>Awesome. So it looks like we'll have examples of different courts in the corebook.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12885-e11even-e11even","name":"E11even-E11even","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12885_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T15:21:02-08:00","id":1159221,"title":"","content":"I don't really like what I've read so far. The writing style seems to just obfuscate everything when I try to read it rather than explain anything. Plus I don't really like returning to the Seasonal courts as a focus, makes me think we're going to get a situation like Vampire where each region is meant to have it's own factions but everyone ends up using the default because of the level of homebrewing required to catch up on the centralism of the default factions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T15:45:45-08:00","id":1159235,"title":"","content":"$7626 to go...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T16:14:29-08:00","id":1159244,"title":"","content":"Backed! Excited about this and to be quite honest I have never played a game of Changeling so I'm excited about this. I have read much of the 1st edition material and dreaming material (although I know it's not similar by any means). Definitely looking forward to seeing more of the preview texts and running a game/playing a game at long last!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Kinda I want to&quot; - Trent Reznor<br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://scontent.ftpa1-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t1.0-9/27973518_2040009129348529_5319855605701568493_n.jpg?oh=9c85c5c9d4a0769a1249ea2f3e62ca43&amp;oe=5B002AA5\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12143-eldritchminister","name":"EldritchMinister","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12143_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T00:29:19-08:00","id":1159362,"title":"","content":"Beside sometimes <i>too</i> flowery language in preview - I found one thing that is weird/annoying - <b><i>Why</i> Courts are before Kiths in document? </b>Seeming and Kith are things you 'take out' from Arcadia, just as you come out from Durance. You join ( or not ) Court in few days/weeks later. Logical 2E corebook 'narrative' would be to point from perspective of abducted mortals, spending time with their Keepers - so choosing Seeming and Kith - and <i>then</i> to talk about Courts on Earth, right?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T06:51:10-08:00","id":1159403,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159221#post1159221\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't really like what I've read so far. The writing style seems to just obfuscate everything when I try to read it rather than explain anything. Plus I don't really like returning to the Seasonal courts as a focus, makes me think we're going to get a situation like Vampire where each region is meant to have it's own factions but everyone ends up using the default because of the level of homebrewing required to catch up on the centralism of the default factions.</div> </div> </div> </div>And yet at the back of the book is a whole thing on how to make your own courts, Courts in other places around the world like New Orleans. So...yeah...having a hard time seeing your argument. V:tR they flat out said these organizations are nation wide across the US and most of the world. Where as they have said every major city has it's own freehold and from that freehold arise courts. While the seasonal narrative is the most common, they clearly show in the same book, other courts and include an easy system for home brewing a freehold/court. To a beast player your argument is on shaky ground to begin with because we have to design the city as a group before we can even play. We have to know what the Apex is, and how it warps our lairs, and effects us.<br /> <br /> While it wouldn't surprise me if the first time ST's run this they run seasonal. I get the feeling by their second or 3 campaign they are using the rules provided to quickly create their own freeholds with their players.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T07:39:15-08:00","id":1159411,"title":"","content":"I'm just happy the seasonal courts are back in because they were a fundamental part of many 1st edition settings - but, most importantly, the Autumn court is one of my favorite faction ever created for a CoD game.<br /> <br /> Now if I can just get the Scarecrow Ministry back as well, I will be a happy pumpkin.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10272-daigotsu-max","name":"Daigotsu Max","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T07:44:41-08:00","id":1159412,"title":"","content":"I don't want it to feel like I'm purposely adding to the dogpile here, but I just finished reading the kiths, and they are an issue. There are an awful lot of words, for an awful little content. The expectation that these 12 will work for most players, or that most players will want to design their own are wildly off mark with my experiences and I'm having reservations about the project now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12885-e11even-e11even","name":"E11even-E11even","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12885_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T08:16:57-08:00","id":1159420,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>E11even-E11even</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159412#post1159412\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't want it to feel like I'm purposely adding to the dogpile here, but I just finished reading the kiths, and they are an issue. There are an awful lot of words, for an awful little content. The expectation that these 12 will work for most players, or that most players will want to design their own are wildly off mark with my experiences and I'm having reservations about the project now.</div> </div> </div> </div> There will be book of Kiths, but I agree, I think some of the fluff could have been trimmed from here and there in the book to make Space for another 12 kiths, giving us at least 24 kiths in the core, just my opinion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T08:46:33-08:00","id":1159436,"title":"","content":"While we're on the subject of hopes, I do hold a small one that 2nd ed. Entitlements might become dominions with more than one rank.<br /> <br /> For example, instead of a Bishopric of Blackbirds, it might be the Church of Blackbirds, with Deacon or Priest as starting entitlements, all the way up to Bishop. The Scarecrow Ministry would start you as a Clerk or Secretary before you go up the ranks to Minister. And so on.<br /> <br /> It wouldn't break my heart too much if that weren't the case-- And anyway, it's easily house-ruled. I just hope a little bit, while we have yet to see the entire text.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13580-hsienfan","name":"Hsienfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13580_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T08:46:43-08:00","id":1159437,"title":"","content":"So about the Fairest blessing, can the receiving character also spend a Willpower point for a +6 total bonus ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13733-betterworldz","name":"BetterWorldz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13733_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T10:06:00-08:00","id":1159467,"title":"","content":"Since there has been some confusion, I wanted to talk a little bit about Regalia.<br /> <br /> Here's a little excerpt from the True Fae section:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> A True Fae is not a person, but a Name wrapped in a tapestry of vows and deals. Deep in the mists of forgotten time, the Fae bargained with Arcadia itself, declaring that they would exist \u2014 that they would own the land entire and claim it as a vessel for their Wyrd, dreams, and facets, in exchange for a web of arcane rules so complex no one of them could ever know them all. At their core, the Fae are ravenous beings that must <i>possess.</i> They want, and in their all-consuming wanting they strike bargains to sate their desires, whether for slaves, kingdoms, secrets, or spoils. </div> </div> </div>And here's a little excerpt from the Arcadian Contracts section:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> The oldest Contracts hail from the dawn of Arcadia, when the True Fae bargained with the world to let them, or sometimes their pawns, move beyond the laws constraining mere mortals. While the Gentry rarely care for the other citizens of Faerie, their omnipresence ensures these bargains also apply to their subjects. Any citizen of Arcadia, including changelings, may claim these rights as Contracts. This claim requires conscious effort, like finding a teacher, reading a tome detailing the Contract, or meditating extensively upon the nature of the deal. It also requires acknowledging her status as a denizen of Arcadia, something a changeling might find empowering as she takes control of her fate, or that might serve as a painful reminder that she is no longer quite human. </div> </div> </div>So here we have the Gentry, desiring absolute dominance over the domain they claimed for themselves. They strike bargains with abstract concepts like &quot;movement&quot; and &quot;change&quot; and &quot;secrets,&quot; gaining all manner of strange and terrible powers, which end up falling into some broad categories representing agreements so unimaginably monumental that we can only conceive of them via symbols. These are what changelings call Regalia. They're general thematic groupings of vast swaths of Fae power, which trickle down to the Lost as Contracts--much narrower in scope than the original bargains they come from. That doesn't mean the Regalia only apply to these Contracts--it's the opposite. These Contracts align with those larger themes. Any type of fae power could theoretically do so.<br /> <br /> Now, a Fae Title's Regalia also have physical representations, which means that on some level, the Gentry also see their bargains this way. Those physical representations are like pulling out the abstract of a thousand-page legal document and transforming it into a symbol that boils down the meaning of all that text into a single object, a concise statement embodied in a velvet cape or shining scepter. The cosmic Arcadian rules that say the Fae are allowed to exist as anything but vague bits of Wyrd and consciousness require them to anchor themselves this way, it's the trade-off they endure for being able to shape the world to their whims.<br /> <br /> So, when they take a human and reshape her into something they want, they infuse her with fae power. That fae power comes from the same vast bargains as the rest of it, which means it could also fall into one of those broad themes. You can see how, for instance, the Playmate could be associated with the themes of the Shield, while the Helldiver could be associated with those of the Steed. There isn't really any kind of systemic meaning to it, but some fae scholars who like classifying things might say &quot;ah yes, it seems to me that these changelings have inherited the power of the Crown&quot; when a particular kith seems to align with a particular set of themes. (And it was a fun and flavorful way to categorize the kiths for the Book of Kiths stretch goals, since they're no longer tied to a single seeming. There are plenty of kiths that wouldn't necessarily fit these six Regalia, and we might see those in the book too.)<br /> <br /> Does that mean every kind of fae power must fall into one of these six categories? Nah, not at all. Changelings have inherited not only the Contracts that derive from the Gentry's original pacts, but also the ability to make new pacts. They can make pledges with all kinds of forces and spirits and weirder things, and learn Contracts that don't fit into any Regalia because they didn't come from the Gentry at all. Or a changeling might encounter fae phenomena of some Regalia that's less common and rarely seen, stemming from different, more unique bargains. These six are just the ones that are best-known, because they're the most extensive.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Meghan Fitzgerald | Onyx Path freelance writer &amp; developer</i><br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\"><i>Changeling: The Lost developer</i></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#009999\"><i>Mage: The Awakening developer</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2229-meghan-fitzgerald","name":"Meghan Fitzgerald","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2229_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"124"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T12:22:41-08:00","id":1159515,"title":"","content":"I want to elaborate on the concerns I have for kiths. I hope nobody from the design team takes this personally, I really love a majority of what I've read unrelated to character creation. <br /> <br /> The issue with kiths is not just the number, but what they are. They're almost all completely torn from 1st edition kiths, which are tailored to specific seemings. So what we have are twelve kiths that really only fit one or two seemings each, but are supposed to be able to flavor any seeming. They just aren't broad enough in their flavors to cover that palette, and it feels like things are missing.<br /> <br /> Where many contradictions in Changeling come across as interesting and maddening juxtapositions, most of these seeming and kith combinations just appear thematically confused. A Wizened hunterheart could work, I guess. But even as someone dragged back through Faerie, that just seems awkward. I could not see a player making that, even less than I could see players wanting to put in the work to come up with their own kiths.<br /> <br /> The kiths don't really come across as ways to color seemings, so much as they feel like more specific versions of them. A gristlegrinder doesn't feel like something you could apply to any seeming, it feels like a more specialized type of Ogre or Beast. Adding a kith feels more akin to choosing a specialty class in something like D &amp; D. A chatelaine is to a Wizened, what a summoner is to a mage.<br /> <br /> The point is well illustrated with Beasts. Right now if I wanted to make a Beast who was part bird or snake, I have no mechanical way to give him flight, or gliding, or poison- all of which feel trickier to apply to a character than a normal roll bonus. On the other side of that coin, if I made a panda Beast, and didn't even add a kith, it would be a very fast and dangerous version of a panda. A Beast's normal blessing is restricting- inherently tying them to fast and dangerous predators- and the kiths available simply don't give enough options to work around that.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12885-e11even-e11even","name":"E11even-E11even","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12885_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T13:48:25-08:00","id":1159548,"title":"","content":"$1985 to go until the next stretch goal. If this pace keeps up, we should hit it in about 3 hours.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T14:56:30-08:00","id":1159574,"title":"","content":"Okay, my only question is how do you keep a Wizened from becoming unbelievably rich with their blessing?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18330-redspieder","name":"Redspieder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar18330_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T15:04:48-08:00","id":1159581,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Redspieder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159574#post1159574\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay, my only question is how do you keep a Wizened from becoming unbelievably rich with their blessing?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> When I ran Mage the Ascension last, characters discussed making themselves rich with magic. Through a mentor npc I advised them that while you can certainly use magic to support yourself, making yourself rich enough to be noticed (say, winning millions in the lottery, manipulating the stock market on a grand scale, etc) would definitely draw the attention of the Technocracy (setting antagonists, if you don't know the game).<br /> <br /> For CtL, while True Fae may not monitor stock trends, I could certainly see it making thematic sense for faerie-gold to have bad fate attached to it if monetized (there's some folklore precedent for that), and that could draw Huntsmen down on you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 11-16-2017, 06:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T15:08:58-08:00","id":1159586,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159581#post1159581\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> When I ran Mage the Ascension last, characters discussed making themselves rich with magic. Through a mentor npc I advised them that while you can certainly use magic to support yourself, making yourself rich enough to draw attention (say, winning millions in the lottery, manipulating the stock market on a grand scale, etc) would definitely draw the attention of the Technocracy (setting antagonists, if you don't know the game).<br /> <br /> For CtL, while True Fae may not monitor stock trends, I could certainly see it making thematic sense for faerie-gold to have bad fate attached to it if monetized (there's some folklore precedent for that), and that could draw Huntsmen down on you.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I love this, thank you for the idea!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18330-redspieder","name":"Redspieder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar18330_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T15:15:30-08:00","id":1159590,"title":"","content":"And I imagine that in general, if this is just the one changeling or motley acting alone, the Courts of your local freehold are going to start being very suspicious of someone suddenly gaining a lot of wealth. Either of them making a particularly big contract with the Wyrd that the changeling/motley decided not to share with the rest of the class, or suspect them of being Loyalist and they're getting some extra benefits from their Gentry and/or Huntsman benefactors.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T15:20:23-08:00","id":1159591,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Redspieder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159586#post1159586\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I love this, thank you for the idea!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> You're welcome! There's a reason leprechauns horde their gold and don't buy &amp; sell with it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T15:50:44-08:00","id":1159602,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Redspieder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159574#post1159574\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay, my only question is how do you keep a Wizened from becoming unbelievably rich with their blessing?</div> </div> </div> </div>A Create Equipment action for a +5 equipment bonus is a roll with a -5 penalty whose failure result is &quot;the item gets made but is fragile or volatile,&quot; you need time and appropriate tools for the process to make the transformation with that level of safety, using improbable tools costs Glamour and treats any failure as a dramatic failure whose results are outright lack-of-success with an extra negative outcome, and getting a reputation for egregious production of resources sounds like a fantastic way to get caught off-guard by unpleasant surprises that will ding your Clarity.<br /> <br /> If a Wizened character can maintain the delicate balance necessary to keep up their seeming's fae alchemy with a regular process that they're good at, they're welcome to their riches.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T16:15:01-08:00","id":1159610,"title":"","content":"$1505 to go. Getting there!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T16:40:29-08:00","id":1159618,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Meghan Fitzgerald</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159467#post1159467\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Since there has been some confusion, I wanted to talk a little bit about Regalia.</div> </div> </div> </div>So that means the Kith book will be focused on only a single theme unless funding allows it to reach more Regalia.... that seems considerably more limited than if you guys had the book be in sets of six so there's the same number of kiths for each regalia and the extra funding just meant more Kiths.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T18:13:17-08:00","id":1159650,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>E11even-E11even</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159515#post1159515\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I want to elaborate on the concerns I have for kiths. I hope nobody from the design team takes this personally, I really love a majority of what I've read unrelated to character creation. <br /> <br /> The issue with kiths is not just the number, but what they are. They're almost all completely torn from 1st edition kiths, which are tailored to specific seemings. So what we have are twelve kiths that really only fit one or two seemings each, but are supposed to be able to flavor any seeming. They just aren't broad enough in their flavors to cover that palette, and it feels like things are missing.<br /> <br /> Where many contradictions in Changeling come across as interesting and maddening juxtapositions, most of these seeming and kith combinations just appear thematically confused. A Wizened hunterheart could work, I guess. But even as someone dragged back through Faerie, that just seems awkward. I could not see a player making that, even less than I could see players wanting to put in the work to come up with their own kiths.<br /> <br /> The kiths don't really come across as ways to color seemings, so much as they feel like more specific versions of them. A gristlegrinder doesn't feel like something you could apply to any seeming, it feels like a more specialized type of Ogre or Beast. Adding a kith feels more akin to choosing a specialty class in something like D &amp; D. A chatelaine is to a Wizened, what a summoner is to a mage.<br /> <br /> The point is well illustrated with Beasts. Right now if I wanted to make a Beast who was part bird or snake, I have no mechanical way to give him flight, or gliding, or poison- all of which feel trickier to apply to a character than a normal roll bonus. On the other side of that coin, if I made a panda Beast, and didn't even add a kith, it would be a very fast and dangerous version of a panda. A Beast's normal blessing is restricting- inherently tying them to fast and dangerous predators- and the kiths available simply don't give enough options to work around that.</div> </div> </div> </div> For a Darkling Gristlegrinder I could see a changeling with a mouth like a blackhole, lips like a burning event horizon.<br /> <br /> A Beast Gristlegrinder could be like Jaws from from the Shark movie.<br /> <br /> An Orger Gristlegrinder could could look like a Gnoll from D&amp;D.<br /> <br /> A Fairest, that ones is a challenge, a I'd go with Denubulans for Star Trek: Enterprise as an inspiration, an attractive person who smile is just to big to be human, like it extends beyond the length a human smile would, and when they open their mouth to swallow you, it's weirdly inviting. <br /> <br /> Wizened, a chubby chief who previous meals stain their chin and shirt, like a messy kid, yet gorier, because its bits of humans mixed in the blood stains.<br /> <br /> An Elemental Gristlegrinder might have a mouth that looks like a giant whirlpool or tornado that sucks things into it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2241,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","user":"Omegaphallic","date":". 11-16-2017, 09:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T18:13:56-08:00","id":1159651,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159618#post1159618\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So that means the Kith book will be focused on only a single theme unless funding allows it to reach more Regalia.... that seems considerably more limited than if you guys had the book be in sets of six so there's the same number of kiths for each regalia and the extra funding just meant more Kiths.</div> </div> </div> </div> I'd be surprised if it doesn't get to all 6 regalia.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T18:22:40-08:00","id":1159653,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159618#post1159618\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So that means the Kith book will be focused on only a single theme unless funding allows it to reach more Regalia.... that seems considerably more limited than if you guys had the book be in sets of six so there's the same number of kiths for each regalia and the extra funding just meant more Kiths.</div> </div> </div> </div>That\u2019s an uncharitable reading. I\u2019d assume instead that the Book of Kiths will now also have a section on the Crown, with kiths based on its themes (which, if I recall correctly, are dominance and command? I may be far off base), in addition to the sections already planned for the book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12958-raz_fox","name":"Raz_Fox","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T19:42:18-08:00","id":1159678,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159650#post1159650\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> For a Darkling Gristlegrinder I could see a changeling with a mouth like a blackhole, lips like a burning event horizon.<br /> <br /> A Beast Gristlegrinder could be like Jaws from from the Shark movie.<br /> <br /> An Orger Gristlegrinder could could look like a Gnoll from D&amp;D.<br /> <br /> A Fairest, that ones is a challenge, a I'd go with Denubulans for Star Trek: Enterprise as an inspiration, an attractive person who smile is just to big to be human, like it extends beyond the length a human smile would, and when they open their mouth to swallow you, it's weirdly inviting.<br /> <br /> Wizened, a chubby chief who previous meals stain their chin and shirt, like a messy kid, yet gorier, because its bits of humans mixed in the blood stains.<br /> <br /> An Elemental Gristlegrinder might have a mouth that looks like a giant whirlpool or tornado that sucks things into it.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think the issue is more one of backstory for wait &quot;the backstory associated with this seeming doesn't really mesh with this kith&quot; rather than &quot;I can't think of how the character will look&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">That\u2019s an uncharitable reading. I\u2019d assume instead that the Book of Kiths will now also have a section on the Crown, with kiths based on its themes (which, if I recall correctly, are dominance and command? I may be far off base), in addition to the sections already planned for the book.</span> </div> </div> </div><br /> The issue is, if we don't reach the other funding bits that means that Crown will get more material than the other kith for basically no reason.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":8331,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","user":"milo v3","date":". 11-16-2017, 10:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T20:01:46-08:00","id":1159683,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159678#post1159678\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The issue is, if we don't reach the other funding bits that means that Crown will get more material than the other kith for basically no reason.</div> </div> </div> </div>You\u2019re still assuming that the Crown was going to get material in the Book of Kiths if we hadn\u2019t gotten that tier funded.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12958-raz_fox","name":"Raz_Fox","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T20:50:22-08:00","id":1159705,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Raz_Fox</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159683#post1159683\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You\u2019re still assuming that the Crown was going to get material in the Book of Kiths if we hadn\u2019t gotten that tier funded.</div> </div> </div> </div>No I'm not....<br /> The single theme I was referring to is the Crown because that is the only tier that has been funded. I didn't make any assumptions about the material which is already present in the book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T21:04:00-08:00","id":1159709,"title":"","content":"$785. Getting close!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T21:24:21-08:00","id":1159714,"title":"","content":"Does anyone know how the Elemental blessing is supposed to be used? The way it is worded is...confusing for me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T22:14:25-08:00","id":1159723,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taidragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159714#post1159714\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does anyone know how the Elemental blessing is supposed to be used? The way it is worded is...confusing for me.</div> </div> </div> </div>When you're touching or surrounded by your element, you can effectively extend the reach/point-of-origin of your mundane actions by up to three yards. A Woodblood in a tree can grapple people from a neighboring branch, an Earthbones on stone or soil can barricade a door without having to touch the walls, a Fireheart can use a candle flame to get a better vantage point to look for a lost item even if they're blindfolded, a Waterborn can carry on a conversation with their lips sealed provided they've got a puddle handy, etc. Elementals treat instances of their element like little bits of themselves.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T22:27:10-08:00","id":1159726,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taidragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159714#post1159714\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does anyone know how the Elemental blessing is supposed to be used? The way it is worded is...confusing for me.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159723#post1159723\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">When you're touching or surrounded by your element, you can effectively extend the reach/point-of-origin of your mundane actions by up to three yards. A Woodblood in a tree can grapple people from a neighboring branch, an Earthbones on stone or soil can barricade a door without having to touch the walls, a Fireheart can use a candle flame to get a better vantage point to look for a lost item even if they're blindfolded, a Waterborn can carry on a conversation with their lips sealed provided they've got a puddle handy, etc. Elementals treat instances of their element like little bits of themselves.</div> </div> </div> </div>Additionally, this extra reach also extends to attacks. Specifically as unarmed attacks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T23:26:09-08:00","id":1159730,"title":"","content":"Ah, okay. That makes much more sense now; thanks guys. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T23:34:37-08:00","id":1159731,"title":"","content":"$320 to go and we have a new stretch goal! At $90,000 Equinox Roads will be added to the PDF compilation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a