":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T23:59:23-08:00","id":1159737,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159731#post1159731\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">$320 to go and we have a new stretch goal! At $90,000 Equinox Roads will be added to the PDF compilation.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmm, I don't have the Equinox Roads PDF...I do have all the other PDFs being offered...but $10 for just Equinox Roads over $17 on DRPG...<br /> <br /> ...<br /> <br /> Sure, why not.<br /> <br /> *bumps up pledge*<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T02:01:00-08:00","id":1159749,"title":"","content":"It just occured to me that a Changeling character I'd thought up a while back is actually not only playable out the gate now, but he's actually far better represented here than he would have been before - Luthor Blackwell, the Beast Artist, with nails like fountain pens, scales tattooed onto his skin, eyes that are pools of ink and ballpoint horns. The Artist kith blessing works incredibly well for him conceptually, given the materials (outside of the paper) would literally be on his body. All he'd be doing is effectively copying them onto stand-in materials. Suddenly I'm really excited to try playing him in a game instead of my Kamen-Rider styled Changelings.<br /> <br /> A brownie for anyone who gets the name his concept was based on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T06:01:12-08:00","id":1159800,"title":"","content":"88k achieved.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>nWoD Warhammer Fantasy RPG,<br /> WoD Wraith: The Oblivion<br /> and Infernum-style Demon: The Descent, Shadows of Abaddon --&gt; <a href=\"http://madnessforums.com/forums/index.php/topic,26.0.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://madnessforums.com/forums/inde...opic,26.0.html</a><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/974-mrparaduo","name":"MrParaduo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar974_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"967"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T06:01:23-08:00","id":1159802,"title":"","content":"And another stretch goal bites the dust!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T06:24:51-08:00","id":1159808,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159802#post1159802\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And another stretch goal bites the dust!</div> </div> </div> </div>Yahoo!!!! and it's a short jump to the next one <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12074-robert-d","name":"Robert D","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T09:39:40-08:00","id":1159890,"title":"","content":"tl;dr: My interpretation of Seemings is they are more figurative/based on a Trauma coping mechanism. So while for one Lost the seeming could be literal, just as many have Kiths seemingly unrelated.<br /> <br /> <br /> I thought I'd add my interpretation to the Seemings Kiths divide. I hear some of your thoughts in how the 12 (so far) kiths provided in the book may fit only 2 or 3 of the Seemings out of 6. But what I've gathered, Seemings may not be what you think they are.<br /> <br /> In 1st Edition, seemings were pretty litteral (beasts were animals, elementals were the elements, fairest were elves, wizened were hunched over knolls, darklings were shadowy creeps, and trolls were large brutes). Which is why it made sense that Kiths were sub groupings of those.<br /> <br /> However, the way I've read 2nd Edition, Seemings are much more figurative in scope. Beasts are beasts not because they were made into animals but because they fit the fairy tale archetype of &quot;Beasts&quot;. Liken it to the story of Beauty and the Beast and it's many reinterpretations. In many reinterpretations, the Beast isn't an animal but is a Beast all the same. Depending on the Char you totally could be a Beast because your keeper made you into an animal and the bestial things have kept with you. But I could also see a person made into a flame with the express purpose of being the wild fire that targets and burns the villages and leaving arcadia and being a beast.<br /> <br /> Seemings, to me, are now a halfway point between a fairy tale archetype as well as a type of trauma coping mechanism.<br /> <br /> So your panda def does not have to be a Beast. Instead maybe they're an elemental, so detached from everyone around them. Or maybe a Fairest. A beast could be an animal but doesn't have to be.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":654,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","user":"xiongrey","date":". 11-17-2017, 12:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T09:58:21-08:00","id":1159898,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159737#post1159737\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hmm, I don't have the Equinox Roads PDF...I do have all the other PDFs being offered...but $10 for just Equinox Roads over $17 on DRPG...<br /> <br /> ...<br /> <br /> Sure, why not.<br /> <br /> *bumps up pledge*</div> </div> </div> </div> It likely won't be the last book added to the Arcadian Bundle, there is still Swords at Dawn and Dancers at Dusk, plus Goblin Market to add.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T10:00:43-08:00","id":1159900,"title":"","content":"$659 to go to adding to the bundle. At $98,000 we have a stretch goal adding Jewels to the Book of Kiths. That will probably take a couple days to reach.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T10:19:01-08:00","id":1159907,"title":"","content":"My reading of kiths in CtL2e is that they seem to be entirely optional. Mainly with this line:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Sometimes, a True Fae needs their servant to be more than just a Fairest or Darkling. </div> </div> </div>Which suggests that some True Fae just stick with the Seeming and nothing else. YMMV on that, but if for whatever reason you have a player that doesn't want a kith, there's nothing stopping them in doing so.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159618#post1159618\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So that means the Kith book will be focused on only a single theme unless funding allows it to reach more Regalia.... that seems considerably more limited than if you guys had the book be in sets of six so there's the same number of kiths for each regalia and the extra funding just meant more Kiths.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Raz_Fox</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159653#post1159653\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That\u2019s an uncharitable reading. I\u2019d assume instead that the Book of Kiths will now also have a section on the Crown, with kiths based on its themes (which, if I recall correctly, are dominance and command? I may be far off base), in addition to the sections already planned for the book.</div> </div> </div> </div>Speaking of they clarified this in the newest Update and...uh...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Several backers have asked about the possibility of an add-on price for Book of Kiths for those pledge tiers not automatically receiving this pdf reward. T<b>here's absolutely an opportunity, but with only one section thus far, it's much too early to fairly price out.</b> So, let's add another section with a stretch goal... and then keep going and growing the book so that we can have the conversation and make something happen! </div> </div> </div>...yeaaaah...as of right now, the Book of Kiths ONLY has the Crown section and nothing else. I personally think it's likely we'll get more Regalia sections then just Crown but a Book of Kiths that doesn't have all 6...yeah I wouldn't be surprised if that would happen. Worse case there's always backwards-converting the 1e kiths or the Hill kiths (the latter which is freely available).<br /> <br /> Take this for what you will.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159898#post1159898\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It likely won't be the last book added to the Arcadian Bundle, there is still Swords at Dawn and Dancers at Dusk, plus Goblin Market to add.</div> </div> </div> </div>In my case, it's the most relevant due to how Equinox Road is the only CtL1e PDF that I don't have. So either way, I'm saving money over just getting the version up on DRPG right now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4418,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","user":"tasti man LH","date":". 11-17-2017, 01:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T10:28:49-08:00","id":1159909,"title":"","content":"Well, technically, kiths were optional in 1e as well. That almost virtually NEVER happened. I can't think of a single PC that I've seen has ever been without a kith. Saying they're optional, from a player standpoint, is pretty much a non-starter at this point. People always craved them, more so than Entitlements, in my experience.<br /> <br /> As for the book of kiths only having a Crown section... that's pretty false. There's already going to be a Kith book, even without Crown. We're just expanding from the base book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T10:39:06-08:00","id":1159912,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159909#post1159909\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...As for the book of kiths only having a Crown section... that's pretty false. There's already going to be a Kith book, even without Crown. We're just expanding from the base book.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is how I read it as well. That there's already a big companion book slated called The Book of Kiths. And these Stretch Goals are adding sections. It is still a little vague if these regalia sections are:<br /> - more kiths that fit that Ragalia<br /> - Kith related Contracts within that regalia<br /> - True Fae Regalia explanations that relate to creating Kiths<br /> <br /> Its all still vague what the added sections are actually adding since, in my understanding, The Book of Kiths was a big book of Kiths that was already going to happen regardless of the stretch goals. I imagine that it's likely going to be either of the first two options and we will at least hit two of the Regalia which means it's not super hard to make our own within the other regalia. (imagine something like 100 kiths in the base BoK with about 12-20 added in each regalia section). <br /> <br /> Just speculation of course, but that's how I read it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T10:41:48-08:00","id":1159913,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159909#post1159909\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, technically, kiths were optional in 1e as well. That almost virtually NEVER happened. I can't think of a single PC that I've seen has ever been without a kith. Saying they're optional, from a player standpoint, is pretty much a non-starter at this point. People always craved them, more so than Entitlements, in my experience.<br /> <br /> As for the book of kiths only having a Crown section... that's pretty false. There's already going to be a Kith book, even without Crown. We're just expanding from the base book.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Book of Kiths currently only has a Crown section, but I expect that we'll manage to get at least one more added to it. If that proves to be the case, it might end up being &quot;Book of Kiths: Crown &amp; Jewels&quot;, but if it proves popular they might create others covering the remaining Regalia.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T10:46:23-08:00","id":1159916,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>White Oak Dragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159913#post1159913\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The Book of Kiths currently only has a Crown section, but I expect that we'll manage to get at least one more added to it. If that proves to be the case, it might end up being &quot;Book of Kiths: Crown &amp; Jewels&quot;, but if it proves popular they might create others covering the remaining Regalia.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm still pretty sure the Book of Kiths would have had a lot of Kiths regardless of our funding. So I'm pretty sure the Regalia sections are just added word count to the main BoK book. Similar to Entitlements in 1st Ed. They gave like 3 or 4 examples and then how to create your own Entitlement. I think this book will have more sections on Kiths than just regalia related with the regalia sections being essentially examples without a need for all (though all would still be awesome so I hope we fund them)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T10:48:16-08:00","id":1159918,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159909#post1159909\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, technically, kiths were optional in 1e as well. That almost virtually NEVER happened. I can't think of a single PC that I've seen has ever been without a kith. Saying they're optional, from a player standpoint, is pretty much a non-starter at this point. People always craved them, more so than Entitlements, in my experience. <br /> As for the book of kiths only having a Crown section... that's pretty false. There's already going to be a Kith book, even without Crown. We're just expanding from the base book.</div> </div> </div> </div> Not only that, but kiths only improve your character, there are no drawbacks. Every player will want them, so citing that they aren't mandatory doesn't fix the issues with them at all.<br /> <br /> Yeah, there will be a kith book, but with what included? Since each seeming has a regalia it seems ridiculous to hide these behind stretch goals. Who wants a supplement book with regalia for just two of the seemings? That favors some seemings above others and leads to an incomplete product. Don't hide what should be core content behind stretch goals. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12885-e11even-e11even","name":"E11even-E11even","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12885_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T10:58:21-08:00","id":1159920,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>E11even-E11even</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159918#post1159918\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Since each seeming has a regalia it seems ridiculous to hide these behind stretch goals. Who wants a supplement book with regalia for just two of the seemings? That favors some seemings above others and leads to an incomplete product. Don't hide what should be core content behind stretch goals.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's assuming that the Regalia sections are what we think they are (a list of Kiths for that regalia). I have doubts that that is the case.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T10:58:47-08:00","id":1159921,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xiongrey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159916#post1159916\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm still pretty sure the Book of Kiths would have had a lot of Kiths regardless of our funding. So I'm pretty sure the Regalia sections are just added word count to the main BoK book. Similar to Entitlements in 1st Ed. They gave like 3 or 4 examples and then how to create your own Entitlement. I think this book will have more sections on Kiths than just regalia related with the regalia sections being essentially examples without a need for all (though all would still be awesome so I hope we fund them)</div> </div> </div> </div>I hope we fund them, too. To be honest, I hope you're right. I say that both as someone who wants to see more kiths and someone who is hoping to be tapped to help write them. The last update said that there was only one section to it, though, so I fear that what we fund may be all we get for that book. I would be absolutely delighted to be wrong about that, though. I also find myself wondering whether the Book of Kiths is the new name for Kith and Kin, or whether it is an additional book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T11:01:17-08:00","id":1159922,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>E11even-E11even</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159918#post1159918\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Not only that, but kiths only improve your character, there are no drawbacks. Every player will want them, so citing that they aren't mandatory doesn't fix the issues with them at all.<br /> <br /> Yeah, there will be a kith book, but with what included? Since each seeming has a regalia it seems ridiculous to hide these behind stretch goals. Who wants a supplement book with regalia for just two of the seemings? That favors some seemings above others and leads to an incomplete product. Don't hide what should be core content behind stretch goals.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's not the only logic involved; as Meghan discussed earlier in the thread, it's which kiths are _thematically_ aligned to what the Regalia represent. So Sword encompasses kiths with themes of strength and aggression, Shield kiths with themes of defense and protection, etc.<br /> <br /> Elementals have an affinity for Sword and Ogres for Shield, but no-one's going to argue only those Seemings can orientate towards the themes of those Regalia.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":51,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","user":"marin","date":". 11-17-2017, 02:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T11:06:05-08:00","id":1159925,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xiongrey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159920#post1159920\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's assuming that the Regalia sections are what we think they are (a list of Kiths for that regalia). I have doubts that that is the case.</div> </div> </div> </div>Even if they aren't kiths for that regalia, each regalia is already tied to a seeming, meaning individual seemings will get more content than others if they aren't all funded.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12885-e11even-e11even","name":"E11even-E11even","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12885_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T11:12:45-08:00","id":1159928,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159922#post1159922\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's not the only logic involved; as Meghan discussed earlier in the thread, it's which kiths are _thematically_ aligned to what the Regalia represent. So Sword encompasses kiths with themes of strength and aggression, Shield kiths with themes of defense and protection, etc.<br /> <br /> Elementals have an affinity for Sword and Ogres for Shield, but no-one's going to argue only those Seemings can orientate towards the themes of those Regalia.</div> </div> </div> </div>I understand, but certain seemings will still benefit more indirectly. If only Crown were to be funded, that would certainly benefit Fairest players more than others. And besides that, I still don't want an incomplete supplement. That annoys me to no end.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12885-e11even-e11even","name":"E11even-E11even","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12885_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T11:32:28-08:00","id":1159933,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>E11even-E11even</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159928#post1159928\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I understand, but certain seemings will still benefit more indirectly. If only Crown were to be funded, that would certainly benefit Fairest players more than others. And besides that, I still don't want an incomplete supplement. That annoys me to no end.</div> </div> </div> </div> I can see why you'd assume that, but there is no mechanical benifet between Crown Kiths and Fairest.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T11:43:48-08:00","id":1159939,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159933#post1159933\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I can see why you'd assume that, but there is no mechanical benifet between Crown Kiths and Fairest.</div> </div> </div> </div>Again it's an issue of &quot;These kiths backstories aren't really compatible with the backstories of all seemings&quot;. And since they're all following the same themes as Fairest, they're primarily going to be compatible with Fairest and need to be sort of wedged in &quot;Square in Circle Hole&quot; style for the other seemings.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T11:50:24-08:00","id":1159942,"title":"","content":"Exactly what Milo said. The connection is indirect and obvious.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12885-e11even-e11even","name":"E11even-E11even","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12885_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T12:04:35-08:00","id":1159948,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159939#post1159939\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Again it's an issue of &amp;quot;These kiths backstories aren't really compatible with the backstories of all seemings&amp;quot;. And since they're all following the same themes as Fairest, they're primarily going to be compatible with Fairest and need to be sort of wedged in &amp;quot;Square in Circle Hole&amp;quot; style for the other seemings.</div> </div> </div> </div> You haven't seen them yet, so that is pure speculation, besides its a dedicated book to Kiths, so each Kith could have Seeming examples for each Seeming (speculation on my part). Heck some Crown Kiths could fit other Seemings better then Fairest, like Shadowsoul.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T12:11:35-08:00","id":1159954,"title":"","content":"And we are now above $90k, people! Time to go for the jewels! (Not in that way! Get your minds out of the gutters!)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/585-seidmadr","name":"Seidmadr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar585_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T12:12:32-08:00","id":1159955,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159948#post1159948\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You haven't seen them yet, so that is pure speculation, besides its a dedicated book to Kiths, so each Kith could have Seeming examples for each Seeming (speculation on my part). Heck some Crown Kiths could fit other Seemings better then Fairest, like Shadowsoul.</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe that will be the case, but the connection between Crown and Fairest is obvious. And the connections between other seemings and regalia are also. I've no reason to believe seemings won't benefit more from their preferred regalia than others. And I still don't want an incomplete supplement. I'd rather it were all-or-nothing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12885-e11even-e11even","name":"E11even-E11even","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12885_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T12:19:01-08:00","id":1159960,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159939#post1159939\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Again it's an issue of &quot;These kiths backstories aren't really compatible with the backstories of all seemings&quot;. And since they're all following the same themes as Fairest, they're primarily going to be compatible with Fairest and need to be sort of wedged in &quot;Square in Circle Hole&quot; style for the other seemings.</div> </div> </div> </div>But any kith can fit with seeming since seemings are more than a litteral example of what it's describing.<br /> <br /> A beast can be an animal but more importantly they are &quot;a beast of a person&quot;, and elemental could litterally be made into fire but more importantly they are &quot;of an elemental nature versus human nature&quot;, a Darkling could be a literal bogeyman but importantly they are &quot;the shadowy person&quot;. They're archetypes and trauma coping mechanisms.<br /> <br /> A Hunterheart could be a Beast but they could just as well be a fairest. A Leechfinger could be a darkling, but it could be a troll too. A fireheart could be an Elemental but also a Wizened. A dancer could be a Fairest but just as easily be a Beast. A Gargantuan could be an Ogre but also a darkling. Chirugeoun could be a Wizened but just as easily be an Elemental.<br /> <br /> The Kith is pretty literally what the Keeper made a changeling into while seeming can be that but is much broader encompassing the idea of that archetype (which means it could be what the keeper did or how the changeling took control of their identity meaning a Beast doesn't need to be an animal to be a Beast and an Elemental doesn't need to be made of fire to be an Elemental).<br /> <br /> <b>Edit:</b> fixed some spelling mistakes ^.^","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T12:28:28-08:00","id":1159970,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>E11even-E11even</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159925#post1159925\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Even if they aren't kiths for that regalia, each regalia is already tied to a seeming, meaning individual seemings will get more content than others if they aren't all funded.</div> </div> </div> </div> I would be very shocked if every regalia doesn't get funded. Maybe a Folklore/Myth section to, for Kiths like Troll, Succubi, Satyr, Nymph, Apsara, Centaur, Cyclops, Rakshasa, Oni, ect...,","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T12:37:14-08:00","id":1159972,"title":"","content":"The association between regalia and seeming might be obvious, but the connection between Book of Kiths: insert favorite Regalia here and seeming isn't. <br /> <br /> The first four books of the 1e game line were Autumn Nightmares, Lords of Summer, Spring Rites and Winter Masques. Despite the names, these four books had almost nothing to do with the actual Seasonal courts. Autumn Nightmares was about antagonists, Winter Masques was about messing with default assumptions of seemings, kiths, non-seasonal court systems and I believe there was a section on the Hedge in there as well; Rites of Spring were a bunch of player options; Lords of Summer was the big book on the Seasonal Courts and Entitlements. <br /> <br /> Book of Kiths: Crown could just have something to do with social groups based on kiths. Hunterhearts hanging out together, artists making up a crafters guild, etc. The Jewel regalia revolves around the theme of transformation, wasn't it? So, the Jewel chapter could talk about how kiths change a person, or the ability to change a kith or adopt a new one<br /> These <b><u>additional</u> </b>chapters could really be anything, given how little we know about the Regalia. Utterly meaningless, if you ask me. Its like saying they'll add a section code named Soup or Magical Girls into the Book of Kiths. What does that even mean?<br /> <br /> ((okay, I admit, I'm down for a Magical Girl chapter. That would be win.))","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T12:59:19-08:00","id":1159982,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159972#post1159972\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">... Book of Kiths: Crown could just have something to do with social groups based on kiths. Hunterhearts hanging out together, artists making up a crafters guild, etc. The Jewel regalia revolves around the theme of transformation, wasn't it? So, the Jewel chapter could talk about how kiths change a person, or the ability to change a kith or adopt a new one<br /> These <b><u>additional</u> </b>chapters could really be anything, given how little we know about the Regalia. ...</div> </div> </div> </div>This is exactly how I was thinking of The Book of Kiths.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T13:13:39-08:00","id":1159987,"title":"","content":"For Kiths associated with Crown (Rulership), I think Muse will be in that category, but I'm not sure what other of the old kiths would fit that Kith.<br /> <br /> Jewel (Manipulation and Temptation) I can see the Succubi Kith (if it doesn't end up with a Folklore section), Troll, Larencist, Chataline if it wasn't already in, Flamesiren, Iles.<br /> <br /> Mirror (Perception and Transformation), Wisp, Mirrorskin if it wasn't already in, Cleareyes, Shadowsoul, Oracle, Oni. <br /> <br /> Sword (Strength and Aggression) Hunterheart &amp; Gristlegrinder would be here if they, weren't already in. Razorfinger, Bloodbrute, Draconian.<br /> <br /> Shield (Defence and Protection) Giant, The White Lady (actual name is German and I forgot it), Metalflesh, Broadback.<br /> <br /> Steed (movement), Helldiver would be here, Tunnelgrub, Windwing.<br /> <br /> Where do you guys think would fit under these catagories?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T13:16:03-08:00","id":1159988,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Seidmadr</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159954#post1159954\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And we are now above $90k, people! Time to go for the jewels! (Not in that way! Get your minds out of the gutters!)</div> </div> </div> </div> The gutter is more fun. <br /> <br /> Anyways, I predict we will have it by 12:00pm tomorrow","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T13:22:40-08:00","id":1159994,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159972#post1159972\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The association between regalia and seeming might be obvious, but the connection between Book of Kiths: insert favorite Regalia here and seeming isn't. <br /> <br /> The first four books of the 1e game line were Autumn Nightmares, Lords of Summer, Spring Rites and Winter Masques. Despite the names, these four books had almost nothing to do with the actual Seasonal courts. Autumn Nightmares was about antagonists, Winter Masques was about messing with default assumptions of seemings, kiths, non-seasonal court systems and I believe there was a section on the Hedge in there as well; Rites of Spring were a bunch of player options; Lords of Summer was the big book on the Seasonal Courts and Entitlements. <br /> <br /> Book of Kiths: Crown could just have something to do with social groups based on kiths. Hunterhearts hanging out together, artists making up a crafters guild, etc. The Jewel regalia revolves around the theme of transformation, wasn't it? So, the Jewel chapter could talk about how kiths change a person, or the ability to change a kith or adopt a new one<br /> These <b><u>additional</u> </b>chapters could really be anything, given how little we know about the Regalia. Utterly meaningless, if you ask me. Its like saying they'll add a section code named Soup or Magical Girls into the Book of Kiths. What does that even mean?<br /> <br /> ((okay, I admit, I'm down for a Magical Girl chapter. That would be win.))</div> </div> </div> </div> They're Kiths accociated with the broad themes of each Regalia, Crown (kiths links to Rulership and Leadership), Jewel (Kiths linked to Manipulation and Temptation), Mirror (Kiths linked to Perception and Transformation), Sword (Kiths linked to Strength and Aggression), Shield (Kiths linked to Defence and Protection), Steed (Kiths linked to Movement).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T13:23:32-08:00","id":1159995,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159972#post1159972\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">These <b><u>additional</u> </b>chapters could really be anything, given how little we know about the Regalia. Utterly meaningless, if you ask me.</div> </div> </div> </div>Except they've clarified that it's not additional chapters, it's just going to be the chapters we unlock. Crown is the only chapter planned for the book until we get more funding. The new kiths we get will specifically only be ones which fit the themes of the funded regalia.<br /> <br /> Also I sincerely doubt we'll be able to get all regalia funded if the kickstarter continues at its current rate + the fact onyx path doesn't seem inclined to having stretch goals which are back to back regalia for the kith book (which is perfectly understandable and reasonable).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T14:18:50-08:00","id":1160010,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1159995#post1159995\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Except they've clarified that it's not additional chapters, it's just going to be the chapters we unlock. Crown is the only chapter planned for the book until we get more funding. The new kiths we get will specifically only be ones which fit the themes of the funded regalia.<br /> <br /> Also I sincerely doubt we'll be able to get all regalia funded if the kickstarter continues at its current rate + the fact onyx path doesn't seem inclined to having stretch goals which are back to back regalia for the kith book (which is perfectly understandable and reasonable).</div> </div> </div> </div> Where did this get mentioned? I don't see it anywhere.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T14:22:43-08:00","id":1160013,"title":"","content":"Forgive me if this already has been asked, but what exactly is the difference between the &quot;traditionally printed, hardcover copy of the CHANGELING: THE LOST 2nd Edition Core Rules&quot; received for pledging $50 (or more), and the &quot;CHANGELING: THE LOST 2ND EDITION CORE BOOK Print on Demand (PoD) version&quot; that you get a coupon for when pledging at that level?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12970-gellydog","name":"Gellydog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12970_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T14:36:10-08:00","id":1160018,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gellydog</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1160013#post1160013\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Forgive me if this already has been asked, but what exactly is the difference between the &quot;traditionally printed, hardcover copy of the CHANGELING: THE LOST 2nd Edition Core Rules&quot; received for pledging $50 (or more), and the &quot;CHANGELING: THE LOST 2ND EDITION CORE BOOK Print on Demand (PoD) version&quot; that you get a coupon for when pledging at that level?</div> </div> </div> </div>You get hard copy of the book that is traditionally printed, and you get discount code to get a Print on Demand copy in case you don't want to risk getting grease or what not from chippy hands on the traditionally printed copy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T14:43:57-08:00","id":1160020,"title":"","content":"Think it's just cosmetic differences (maybe slight size difference), but the Print on Demand coupon is just a discount, so you would have to put some money down for the book at DriveThruRPG when you actually got it, if you wanted it.<br /> <br /> I'm guessing they're not going to add a leather bound or woodcut stretch goal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T16:14:50-08:00","id":1160036,"title":"","content":"I honestly wish the stretch goals were leatherbound or woodcut instead of what we have. This carrot-on-a-stick approach for content that is conspicuously sparse in the core book leaves a bad taste in my mouth.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12885-e11even-e11even","name":"E11even-E11even","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12885_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T16:55:46-08:00","id":1160049,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1160010#post1160010\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Where did this get mentioned? I don't see it anywhere.</div> </div> </div> </div>James Bell clarifed it in the comments iirc, and that's part of the reason why they're waiting for more regalia to be added before they can decide if it's large enough to be an add on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T17:09:25-08:00","id":1160051,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1160049#post1160049\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">James Bell clarifed it in the comments iirc, and that's part of the reason why they're waiting for more regalia to be added before they can decide if it's large enough to be an add on.</div> </div> </div> </div>Here's the quote:<br /> &quot;Several backers have asked about the possibility of an add-on price for Book of Kiths for those pledge tiers not automatically receiving this pdf reward. There's absolutely an opportunity, but with only one section thus far, it's much too early to fairly price out. So, let's add another section with a stretch goal... and then keep going and growing the book so that we can have the conversation and make something happen!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12885-e11even-e11even","name":"E11even-E11even","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12885_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T17:26:58-08:00","id":1160054,"title":"","content":"Okay, let's talk numbers people. As far as I can tell, the most successful CofD Kickstarter to date has been Demon. It made about $150k. By day four (on Kicktraq), it had raised about $82.2k. We are just about to finish day 4, as Kicktraq counts them (so really day 3 and a half) and Changeling is just shy of $91.4k. <br /> <br /> I think it is safe to say we are going to hit a metric shit ton of stretch goals still, and a lot of people are going to get a lot of extra content on top of what reward tier they pledge for. Depending of the order of the stretch goals, hitting all six regalia for the Book of Kiths is plausible.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T17:36:15-08:00","id":1160057,"title":"","content":"Man I didn't know we were doing so good!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T17:41:53-08:00","id":1160060,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_post