 is a roundabout way of doing things for sure.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Completed campaign: Scion 2nd Edition. Les L\u00e9gendes Currently playing: Being a dad for a 3 year old daughter and a 2 years old son and now a beautiful new baby.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11312-maitrecorbo","name":"Maitrecorbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11312_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"719"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-25T19:59:55-08:00","id":1162609,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maitrecorbo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1162600#post1162600\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> i think he means you put the 15$ unattached to anything first, and when the add-on is available you take the add-on and delete the random 15$.<br /> No idea if i'm explaining it well.<br /> It is a roundabout way of doing things for sure.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, you don't actually assign extra money to add-ons until after the campaign ends anyway. Unless kickstarter added a new feature very recently.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13075-malicwanderer","name":"MalicWanderer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13075_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-25T20:08:36-08:00","id":1162613,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MalicWanderer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1162609#post1162609\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well, you don't actually assign extra money to add-ons until after the campaign ends anyway. Unless kickstarter added a new feature very recently.</div> </div> </div> </div> They actually did (automatic currency conversions) it's not that one. The net effect is the same, but people still probably won't do it until after the is hit just in case.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-26T05:15:03-08:00","id":1162694,"title":"","content":"So, one thing I notice about these new Contracts. There's talk about doing things like playing a silver flute, or folding an origami crane out of a leaf, or jumping up and down to regale the Wyrd with stories of your athletic prowess. Then, the Action is declared to be Instant. As per page 20 of the WoD core book, Instant Actions are defined as taking between 1 to 3 seconds. <br /> <br /> Just... how much are these actions actually required? Some of them are tied into loopholes, so it doesn't feel like just some random flavor text. But these actions definitely take more than just three seconds, let alone in the middle of a social situation or combat or chase.<br /> <br /> And, while I'm on the matter, what's with the intent behind the Blessing of Perfection and other powers with a duration of one turn? Lets say, to illustrate a point here, we have a changeling using Blessing of Perfection on someone else. That person gets the changeling's Wyrd in place of Crafts, Computer, and Medicine. Now, taking an action to analyze something using Wits+Skill would work. But actually designing something with Crafts, writing a program, trying to heal someone... those all take more time than just one turn. How the heck does that work? Should we be considering one action instead of one turn? Because three seconds worth of Crafts for a painting that takes several minutes to finish is kind of... well, odd. <br /> <br /> Are these abilities just written with different definitions of Instant and Turn than I'm used to?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-26T12:39:28-08:00","id":1162766,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1162596#post1162596\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Except that's be abit weird of a thing to do since that'd mean we'd be paying for the add-on twice....</div> </div> </div> </div>How do you figure...you add $15 to your pledge beyond what you already pledged.<br /> When the survey comes out you say &quot;Hey I'd like to put my extra $15 to get this.&quot;<br /> <br /> That's paying for it once.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-26T12:43:06-08:00","id":1162767,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HaplessWithDice</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1162766#post1162766\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> How do you figure...you add $15 to your pledge beyond what you already pledged.<br /> When the survey comes out you say &quot;Hey I'd like to put my extra $15 to get this.&quot;<br /> <br /> That's paying for it once.</div> </div> </div> </div>No I think the way how it is is that all backers who pledged for any tiers that come with the PDF will get the Kith and Kin PDF for free regardless. <br /> <br /> The add-on for Kith and Kin is either for the people who didn\u2019t pledge for the CtL2 PDF, or to gift to people who didn\u2019t pledge at all.<br /> <br /> If someone were to pledge for any of the tiers with the PDF and gets the add-on, they\u2019d end up with two copies of Kith and Kin.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-26T12:58:20-08:00","id":1162771,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1162767#post1162767\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> No I think the way how it is is that all backers who pledged for any tiers that come with the PDF will get the Kith and Kin PDF for free regardless. <br /> <br /> The add-on for Kith and Kin is either for the people who didn\u2019t pledge for the CtL2 PDF, or to gift to people who didn\u2019t pledge at all.<br /> <br /> If someone were to pledge for any of the tiers with the PDF and gets the add-on, they\u2019d end up with two copies of Kith and Kin.</div> </div> </div> </div>No, I was confused by that at first as well but the kith book doesn't come with pdf only pledges, only ones with a hardcopy. Hence the addition of the add on. Pdf only pledges do get the companion included free, tho, which is why I was confused originally. It's easy to just assume both stretch goal books come with the same pledges.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13075-malicwanderer","name":"MalicWanderer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13075_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-26T13:04:39-08:00","id":1162774,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1162694#post1162694\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, one thing I notice about these new Contracts. There's talk about doing things like playing a silver flute, or folding an origami crane out of a leaf, or jumping up and down to regale the Wyrd with stories of your athletic prowess. Then, the Action is declared to be Instant. As per page 20 of the WoD core book, Instant Actions are defined as taking between 1 to 3 seconds. <br /> <br /> Just... how much are these actions actually required? Some of them are tied into loopholes, so it doesn't feel like just some random flavor text. But these actions definitely take more than just three seconds, let alone in the middle of a social situation or combat or chase.</div> </div> </div> </div>With loopholes I'd imagine you have to perform the loophole action before invoking the contract to get the benefit. So, for example, you either pay the glamour or have to spend an extra few turns folding that origami crane.<br /> <br /> Actually, I'm glad you pointed this out, because if my interpretation is right it might solve a problem I was having with some of the loopholes seeming very easy for how much glamour they're saving you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link