vid Hill version.</div> </div> </div> </div>They picked a helluva time to back out now...especially since even if they weren't closely following the controversies, it should have been obvious from the earliest manuscripts that this wasn't Hill's Changeling. Feels a bit off in that regard...<br /> <br /> Although I suppose it doesn't matter now. Since as of this post we just crossed $138k.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-11T13:41:27-08:00","id":1166795,"title":"","content":"Also, remember that &quot;Superbacker&quot; is a vanity tag that just means, &quot;backs a lot of projects.&quot; It doesn't actually mean anything, even how much they pledge on average. It's at least 25 projects a year at $10. I've gladly dropped more than $250 on single projects and because I don't back that many, I don't get the label.<br /> <br /> Though yeah, dropping over the Hill issue in the last few days does seem... strange.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-11T13:45:46-08:00","id":1166798,"title":"","content":"$2096 away from the next goal. About $3500 raised so far today and still counting. We're doing just dandy.","signature