795\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, remember that &quot;Superbacker&quot; is a vanity tag that just means, &quot;backs a lot of projects.&quot; It doesn't actually mean anything, even how much they pledge on average. It's at least 25 projects a year at $10. I've gladly dropped more than $250 on single projects and because I don't back that many, I don't get the label.<br /> <br /> Though yeah, dropping over the Hill issue in the last few days does seem... strange.</div> </div> </div> </div> I think the guy hadn't had a chance to read through the manuscript in it's entirity until now.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1166798#post1166798\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">$2096 away from the next goal. About $3500 raised so far today and still counting. We're doing just dandy.</div> </div> </div> </div> I'm starting to feel better now, thanks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2241,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","user":"Omegaphallic","date":". 12-11-2017, 05:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-11T14:24:52-08:00","id":1166813,"title":"","content":"The reasons the guy quoted were from how the material had changed from what he enjoyed, to something he didn\u2019t. He didn\u2019t mention any controversies, and though I am a little critical of his timing, I respect his decision not to back the game. He did say he would buy the PDF when I was out, so that\u2019s something. The moderators for the project also respected his wishes, so it may be best to drop this part of the topic since I don\u2019t see it being very productive.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-11T14:39:33-08:00","id":1166822,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">US$ 139,024 out of $157,000</span></span></span><br /> <br /> Will we make it to that shining milestone, and achieve the ultimate wish of all six regalia in Kith and Kin? Or shall we fall short, with great wailing and gnashing of teeth? <br /> STAY TUNED","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-11T14:40:52-08:00","id":1166823,"title":"","content":"Have we effectively written off any chance for the last two Regalia to appear in Kith and Kin? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/618-branford","name":"branford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar618_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1904"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-11T14:49:04-08:00","id":1166825,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>branford</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1166823#post1166823\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Have we effectively written off any chance for the last two Regalia to appear in Kith and Kin? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div> We need to pull in $7,000 total today, tomorrow $7000, and $7,000.<br /> <br /> It is only a little more then demon earned in its last three days, so it possible still, uncertain by far, but possible.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-11T14:50:04-08:00","id":1166826,"title":"","content":"I haven't... I'm trying again on anyone I know. I do have a bit of a problem that... it'd be super uncomfortable for me to share this on social media since David Hill and I (though he isn't posting a huge amount) are connected on there along with other mutual acquaintances (I met him because I did a gaming blog with his wife.) And I know there are those who know about the Kickstarter and agonized like me over supporting it. I don't want to twist the knife. But everyone else, I'm pushing hard.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />\u200bWhen noise turns to silence, when colors dull and pale, when reality no longer makes sense, there shall you find me. There, in the dreams of the River of Faceless Millions, do I dwell.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/\" target=\"_blank\">http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/</a> for my art.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/378-haren","name":"haren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar378_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"664"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-11T14:51:25-08:00","id":1166827,"title":"","content":"Someone a few pages back mentioned that the next kith and kin stretch goals are at 142K, 150K and 157K. If we hit 157K, we get all six Regalia. Assuming the other post is correct. Assuming I remember the other post right. And others have mentioned that getting 160K is doable - last few days of the kickstarters usually see an 11th hour burst of pledges, before the end. Not as big as the initial, of course, but its a trend. So, its entirely possible to still make the full book.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-11T15:07:23-08:00","id":1166833,"title":"","content":"Sorry if this has been explained already, but has there been an official post explaining what the Companion is? It is the same as the Kith and Kin book, yes? Will it have more kiths in general in it or are they all going to be tied to the things that have been unlocked? Because I can't really find anywhere on the site where it says that any kiths will be in the book, other than the name.<br /> <br /> Basically I'm just very confused and I don't feel like the KS has been very clear about what it is, and I was hoping someone might be able to point me at an official explanation of what's going on with that book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":226,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","user":"BrilliantRain","date":". 12-11-2017, 06:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-11T15:12:55-08:00","id":1166834,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>James Bell on KS comments</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"> <span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Not sure if anything truly detailed about the Companion or Kith &amp; Kin is available because they\u2019re just at the first stages of development and final size may depend on stretch goals achieved.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">But, as of now, Companion will contain sections expanding on Entitlements, Freeholds, &amp; Courts (hooray!).</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>Hope this helps you!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />\u200bWhen noise turns to silence, when colors dull and pale, when reality no longer makes sense, there shall you find me. There, in the dreams of the River of Faceless Millions, do I dwell.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/\" target=\"_blank\">http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/</a> for my art.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/378-haren","name":"haren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar378_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"664"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-11T21:31:01-08:00","id":1166908,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">I made the following post on facebook to advertise the Kickstarter. I'm sharing it here because I added up the regular drivethrurpg prices for some of the add-ons and the like, and compared them to the Kickstarter prices. I figured this way, anyone who's looking for that information could get it easily without having to add them up personally. I put it in spoiler tags so that those that aren't interested in it can easily ignore it.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Awhile ago, I said that this Kickstarter was the best deal for obtaining Changeling: The Lost products, and I promised a breakdown of the numbers involved. Here they are. Now that we're in the last couple days, I hope to spread this far and wide.</div></div> </div> </div></span></span></span></span></span><div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">First: The physical book. $50 starting pledge for a high quality shiny hardcover, which also includes a pdf copy, a print on demand discount coupon, and a metric assload of stretch goals. On drivethrurpg, based on the prices for the other game lines' core books, the cheapest is likely to be $40, for the standard print on demand version, or $45 for one that also includes the pdf. The standard never seemed sufficient to me for the art heavy corebooks, though, so let's look at the premium version. That one's likely to be $60, or $65 with pdf included. It's higher quality than the standard, but still not quite as good as the version we get through the Kickstarter. Yes, for the price of a Premium hardcover alone, you can get a higher quality hardcover, a pdf, all those stretch goals, and even a bundle that includes pdfs of damn near every 1E Changeling: The Lost book ever printed, all while encouraging future products to be made or expanded.</span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Second: The pdf of the book. $20 starting pledge for that. Yes, that's the same price it's likely to be on drivethrurpg, but the drivethrurpg version isn't going to come with the lovely stretch goals. If you're international and worried about shipping, there's even a reward tier that comes with a print-on-demand discount coupon starting at $35.</span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">But what if you're only interested in the first edition? Well, the Arcadian Memories add-on (which is also a standalone reward tier in its own right, as well as being included in some other reward tiers) has you covered. For $10, you can get almost every Changeling 1E ever made. It's up to 11 titles right now, with more being added with stretch goals. For the pdfs of the included titles alone on drivethrurpg, you'd be looking at $152. Even the discounted bundle there only brings it down $134. For the Kickstarter, it's only $10! That's cheaper than most of the books included individually, so it would be a deal even if you're only missing one of them!</span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Interested in expanding into some of the other games? There are add-ons available for some of those, too. There's a $55 add-on for the Chronicles of Darkness core rule book, as well as the core rule books for the second editions of Vampire: The Requiem, Werewolf: The Forsaken, Mage: The Awakening, and Promethean: The Created. Those would collectively cost $100 on drivethrurpg.</span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">All of the numbers I've given don't even touch upon the prices saved on the projects that are created by the stretch goals. Even ignoring those, it is a better deal to back the Kickstarter than to try to get it later. Factor in those, and it just keeps getting better. Thank you for your time. Please spread the word.</span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">#Changeling</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">#ChangelingTheLost</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">#GetLost</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/changeling-the-lost-2nd-edition</span></span></span></span></span></div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":309,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","user":"White Oak Dragon","date":".  It broke it into multiple spoiler tags. I tried to fix that. 12-12-2017, 12:36 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-11T23:16:23-08:00","id":1166920,"title":"","content":"We are now at (almost) $140.5k - so only next $1.5k and we will have Shield Kiths! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 12-12-2017, 02:19 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-11T23:37:48-08:00","id":1166921,"title":"","content":"New stretch goals added: at $144k &quot;Swords at Dawn&quot; will be added to the Arcadian Memories bundle. And of course, at $150k, the Steed Kiths get added to the Kith and Kin book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-12T04:52:27-08:00","id":1166950,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1166833#post1166833\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorry if this has been explained already, but has there been an official post explaining what the Companion is?</div> </div> </div> </div> There's been some posts that talk about how the Companion book deals with Freeholds, Courts and Entitlements in greater detail, which is distinct from the Kith and Kin book. The Kith book deals with new kiths, and possibly some about the Seemings? Two separate books here.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-12T05:57:47-08:00","id":1166966,"title":"","content":"Well, I made up an Changeling NPC for my GM in the Mage game we're in. It was easy. Some of it might have been having a solid sense of the character, but some of it was definitely the system. Overall, I considered this a positive experience and shows how much the system has grown. I will say this, Seeming being unlinked to Kith allowed for what might seem an unlikely character combination (Wizened Flowering), but it really fit the character.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />\u200bWhen noise turns to silence, when colors dull and pale, when reality no longer makes sense, there shall you find me. There, in the dreams of the River of Faceless Millions, do I dwell.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/\" target=\"_blank\">http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/</a> for my art.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/378-haren","name":"haren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar378_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"664"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-12T06:05:47-08:00","id":1166968,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>haren</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1166966#post1166966\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, I made up an Changeling NPC for my GM in the Mage game we're in. It was easy. Some of it might have been having a solid sense of the character, but some of it was definitely the system. Overall, I considered this a positive experience and shows how much the system has grown. I will say this, Seeming being unlinked to Kith allowed for what might seem an unlikely character combination (Wizened Flowering), but it really fit the character.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I really prefer Seeming disconnected from Kith. It really opens up for variety without a huge amount of homebrewing and without having to make a trillion Kiths for each Seeming. Now we only need a <i>single</i> trillion Kiths shared by <i>all</i> the Seemings!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-12T06:50:32-08:00","id":1166977,"title":"","content":"Nevermind. Derp.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>SWTOR Referal: <a href=\"http://www.swtor.com/r/JQ2nqy\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.swtor.com/r/JQ2nqy</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/414-gallus","name":"Gallus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar414_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"886"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-12T06:52:29-08:00","id":1166978,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gallus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1166977#post1166977\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I just noticed the expected fulfillment date is June...2019. -_-</div> </div> </div> </div>OP