],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-12T12:00:19-08:00","id":1167067,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1166950#post1166950\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> There's been some posts that talk about how the Companion book deals with Freeholds, Courts and Entitlements in greater detail, which is distinct from the Kith and Kin book. The Kith book deals with new kiths, and possibly some about the Seemings? Two separate books here.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm pretty sure that Kith and Kin (as in total) is more about adding player options kinda like a Player's Guide. The Regalia we're adding now w/ the kickstarter is what they are calling the Book of Kiths which makes it seem like the Book of Kiths will be a seperate chapter (with a section for each Regalia) dealing with lists of Kiths associated with each Regalia's themes. <br /> <br /> The Kith and Kin book as a whole seems focused on giving player's more options beyond just Kiths.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/44