gests it will, although the projection is more pessimistic.</div> </div> </div> </div>Just following up on my previous point, we have now fundraised about equal to the High Range Projection that Kicktraqs was making the day that you posted this. The projection is just that, but it makes is projections day by day, not based on the typical &quot;trends&quot; I've seen several projects pass the High Range Projects for the entire campaign that day that projection was made, especially in the final three days.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-12T17:55:30-08:00","id":1167192,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1167188#post1167188\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just following up on my previous point, we have now fundraised about equal to the High Range Projection that Kicktraqs was making the day that you posted this. The projection is just that, but it makes is projections day by day, not based on the typical &quot;trends&quot; I've seen several projects pass the High Range Projects for the entire campaign that day that projection was made, especially in the final three days.</div> </div> </div> </div> Good to know. It's been a wild ride so far and well over a day to go.<br /> <br /> According to Kicktraq we've gained over $7,500 today and there is still time for more.<br /> <br /> Once this is funded I will own or have payed for every Changeling 2e book that we know about in advance, except for The Hedge, which appears to still be a thing according to Meghan's podcast. <br /> <br /> Changeling 2e Corebook, Kith and Kin, Changeling 2e Companion, Dark Eras 2 (I have DE 1, but don't count it for obvious reasons), Changeling 2e Jumpstart, Winter Novella, Spring Novella, Summer Novella, Autumn Novella, Changeling 2e Anthology.<br /> <br /> I just checked Kicktraq current projections and the low end projects just over $145,000 (it's already over $147,000). Just found that funny.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2241,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/me