s=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Even the fancy-lookin' versions? Also, thank you.</div> </div> </div> </div>Erm, to my understanding, this isn't correct.<br /> <br /> If you pull your pledge, and don't back before the Kickstarter ends tomorrow, you're out. You're options become: buy stuff when it comes out on DriveThruRPG, hope stuff you want is available on Onyx Path's IPR store after backer fulfillment is over, or hope someone is selling/reselling their backer rewards.<br /> <br /> You could, in theory, reduce your pledge to the minimum to receive access to the BackerKit system (I don't know what that is), which generally allows you to add add-ons (though it's up to Onyx Path which are available there, it's not automatic). But this saves you zero money (it's meant to allow people that messed up their pledge math to get the add-ons they want), and just reduces the Kickstarter total on the rest of us.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-13T13:59:09-08:00","id":1167407,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1167404#post1167404\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> Erm, to my understanding, this isn't correct.<br /> <br /> If you pull your pledge, and don't back before the Kickstarter ends tomorrow, you're out. You're options become: buy stuff when it comes out on DriveThruRPG, hope stuff you want is available on Onyx Path's IPR store after backer fulfillment is over, or hope someone is selling/reselling their backer rewards.<br /> <br /> You could, in theory, reduce your pledge to the minimum to receive access to the BackerKit system (I don't know what that is), which generally allows you to add add-ons (though it's up to Onyx Path which are available there, it's not automatic). But this saves you zero money (it's meant to allow people that messed up their pledge math to get the add-ons they want), and just reduces the Kickstarter total on the rest of us.</div> </div> </div> </div>Gotcha. Thank you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12885,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12885-e11even-e11even","user":"E11even-E11even","date":". 12-13-2017, 05:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12885-e11even-e11even","name":"E11even-E11even","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12885_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-13T14:19:12-08:00","id":1167414,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1167391#post1167391\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ok...I\u2019m not sure how much this matters but the Token stretch goal isn\u2019t listed on the KS page.<br /> <br /> Might be just a case of that stretch goal was accidentally revealed too early but...yeah.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, maybe they will release it anyway regardless of how much money they got.......yeah, I am setting my hopes up for disappointment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2179-lokiravenspeak","name":"LokiRavenSpeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-13T14:23:57-08:00","id":1167416,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LokiRavenSpeak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1167414#post1167414\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah, maybe they will release it anyway regardless of how much money they got.......yeah, I am setting my hopes up for disappointment.</div> </div> </div> </div>...and then the stretch goal is listed again in the latest KS update. <br /> <br /> Well ok then.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-13T15:01:55-08:00","id":1167425,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4418_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4418\" data-vbnamecard=\"4418\">tasti man LH</a> he'd mentioned it in the comments of the Kickstarter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />\u200bWhen noise turns to silence, when colors dull and pale, when reality no longer makes sense, there shall you find me. There, in the dreams of the River of Faceless Millions, do I dwell.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/\" target=\"_blank\">http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/</a> for my art.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/378-haren","name":"haren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar378_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"664"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-13T15:55:02-08:00","id":1167436,"title":"","content":"Has anyone mentioned yet the near-pun of <i>Pledging</i> to the CtL2e Kickstarter? <br /> <br /> Cause it took me a month to see how fittingly coincidental that is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-13T16:25:43-08:00","id":1167443,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xiongrey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1167436#post1167436\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Has anyone mentioned yet the near-pun of <i>Pledging</i> to the CtL2e Kickstarter? <br /> <br /> Cause it took me a month to see how fittingly coincidental that is.</div> </div> </div> </div> I hadn't thought of that, it is fitting. Anyways. <br /> <br /> &quot;KITH &amp; KIN - Together, we've unlocked 5 of 6 regalia-themed additions, adding more kith and options for your Changeling: The Lost second edition game. This PDF supplement will also include other kiths that don't fall into any of those categories, as well as some information about Contracts of other- or no-Regalia and striking deals to learn them, advice and best practices for players, and more about the everyday lives of fae beings in general.&quot;<br /> <br /> I knew this was collectively too much money to be just a book of just Kiths. So we will get a ton of kiths, but also new contracts, including alternate regalia and none regalia based contracts and rules for making those kinds of deals. A look into the day to day life of the fae, advice for players and so on. So Kith and Kin is both a book of Kiths, but also a Player's Guide kind of book.<br /> <br /> &quot;CHANGELING: THE LOST 2nd Edition COMPANION - Want more rules, examples, options, and inspiration? Over the course of the campaign, we've added three sections (so far -*entitlements, freeholds, courts) to this PDF supplement, which will update Entitlements for 2e and give some examples. It will discuss the ins-and-outs of what a freehold does day-to-day and how it can be structured, and provide some more example freeholds with expanded setting information and story hooks (maybe with some NPCs!) The supplement will also expand on courts, including some information on making Bargains with new court patrons, and on expanding the role and function of Mantles. And of course, more example courts, including Mantles, Contracts, and other mechanics to go along with them. Again, this PDF supplement will be a bonus reward to all backers receiving a PDF version of the second edition Core Rules.'<br /> <br /> So we will be getting rules for Entitlements, with some some actual entitlements, new Freeholds settings including NPCs maybe, an insight into day to day functions and roles in a freehold, new Courts including Contracts/Bargains/Mantle, and interestingly bargaining with new Court Patrons.<br /> <br /> Anyone else notice that so far the Changeling Companion has a political organization theme, Freeholds, Courts, Entitlements are the political organizations that none loyalist Changelings organize themselves into.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2241,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","user":"Omegaphallic","date":". 12-13-2017, 08:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-13T17:37:04-08:00","id":1167457,"title":"","content":"And we've hit $155k: the Goblins will open the Market once again for the Arcadian Memories bundle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-13T20:58:50-08:00","id":1167498,"title":"","content":"We hit 157,000 Victorian Lost will be added to the Arcadian Memories Bundle. If the next 12 hours equals the last 12 hours (which generated over $9,000) we would get Tokens Chapter for the Companion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-13T21:02:24-08:00","id":1167499,"title":"","content":"AND we hit Victorian Lost now! So we head to Tokens as $165k goal in 12 hours till KS end! I think it's doable to get Tokens chapter in Companion - we hit $7k in less than 14 hours - and we know closer to end, larger the spending. Who knows - maybe I will rise my pledge to get this Arcadian Memories bundle in the end...<br /> P.S. In time of writing this post I saw we got extra $300 so I think it's more doable. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 12-14-2017, 12:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-13T21:02:29-08:00","id":1167500,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1167498#post1167498\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We hit 157,000 Victorian Lost will be added to the Arcadian Memories Bundle. If the next 12 hours equals the last 12 hours (which generated over $9,000) we would get Tokens Chapter for the Companion.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's through the night, homie.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12885-e11even-e11even","name":"E11even-E11even","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12885_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-13T21:09:05-08:00","id":1167506,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>E11even-E11even</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1167500#post1167500\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's through the night, homie.</div> </div> </div> </div>Eh, timezones being what they are and having a couple of nightbirds and/or early birds around here could bump it up. I admit, I don't know about an additional $8k bump up, but we'll see. We did have a lot of belief there was no way we were getting all six Regalia kiths in the Kith and Kin book.<br /> <br /> <i>~the Wyrd works in mysterious ways after all~</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4418,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","user":"tasti man LH","date":". 12-14-2017, 12:11 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-13T21:10:55-08:00","id":1167508,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>E11even-E11even</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1167500#p