""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12885-e11even-e11even","name":"E11even-E11even","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12885_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T15:17:42-08:00","id":1178967,"title":"","content":"Oh and in case anyone is wondering why the BackerKit links seem to be slow to send out or why most people don't have them, Jamie had this to say:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> ...it's a slow roll out because Backerkit does what they call a &quot;smoke test.&quot; Initially, they send out about 5% of the surveys across all levels to see if responses are working and people are able to answer, and if there are any errors I've made. If things look good, then they roll it out to everyone.<br /> <br /> What they're trying to avoid is a mistake-filled survey immediately sent to 2500 people, when they could have learned the issue and corrected it by only hitting 100. Looks like the initial back have gone out, and are being completed, so I'd expect to see an e-mail within the next 30 hours. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T17:12:17-08:00","id":1179016,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"q