,"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-24T11:08:50-07:00","id":1238288,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1238281#post1238281\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Has anyone noticed anything different compared to the manuscript yet, like rule changes?</div> </div> </div> </div>Was there anything particular in the KS drafts that people felt like needed to be addressed?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>gscrap</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1238286#post1238286\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Has anyone seen a ballpark estimate for the release of the Kith and Kin book? I'm not seeing it in the project updates so I've got to guess it's a long way off...</div> </div> </div> </div>Nope.<br /> <br /> The MMNs so far lead me to the impression that the Jumpstart and the Companion are the priority.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-24T12:18:58-07:00","id":1238321,"title":"","content":"I have a question - maybe it is obvious - how are one to know which court contracts go with which of the seasonal/tidal/market courts from chapter 6 in the book? Was this resolved somewhere in the notes or unofficial FAQ, or will it become clearer in the companion, or am I just missing the clarification in the book? Sorry if this is dense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/668-hoodedclaw","name":"hoodedclaw","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-24T13:13:19-07:00","id":1238342,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hoodedclaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1238321#post1238321\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have a question - maybe it is obvious - how are one to know which court contracts go with which of the seasonal/tidal/market courts from chapter 6 in the book? Was this resolved somewhere in the notes or unofficial FAQ, or will it become clearer in the companion, or am I just missing the clarification in the book? Sorry if this is dense.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't think there's any assigned thing there---it's more likely that you're meant to make up their suites of Court Contracts, or at least decide for yourself what non-seasonal Court borrows what suite of seasonal Contracts. I don't know if the Companion will feature information to this end, but I hope it does.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-24T13:19:51-07:00","id":1238346,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hoodedclaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1238321#post1238321\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have a question - maybe it is obvious - how are one to know which court contracts go with which of the seasonal/tidal/market courts from chapter 6 in the book? Was this resolved somewhere in the notes or unofficial FAQ, or will it become clearer in the companion, or am I just missing the clarification in the book? Sorry if this is dense.</div> </div> </div> </div>There isn't.<br /> <br /> The Court Contracts were never written up for the Signature Setting Courts. It's unknown if they will ever be officially written up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-24T16:22:03-07:00","id":1238408,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1238346#post1238346\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> There isn't.<br /> <br /> The Court Contracts were never written up for the Signature Setting Courts. It's unknown if they will ever be officially written up.</div> </div> </div> </div> And THAT was one of the the few things that I felt needed to be fixed and wasn't. The other was that there are too few Kiths in the core (yes I know K&amp;K has more, but it shouldn't feel like it's needed, which it does, <br /> instead of simply bonus content), and both problems have the same cause, the seasonal courts take up too much space, there should have been one emotional court contract that worked differently for different courts, based on their emotions and/or ideal, and each court in the book should have gotten 1 Royal Contract and 1 Common Contract, instead the Seasonal Courts get everything and the other courts get nothing in regards to court contracts, which means that few people will bother with most of them. To be fair I really only liked the New Orleans Court, but with no court contracts it's not fully ready for use in my opinion. I think we will like get the court contracts for these setting in the companion, which means you need a separate book to make these core settings function. I honestly think if they we're going to do this, they should just have made all the settings in the core Variant Seasonal Courts like they did for Iceland (I might steal the Christmas party Elves courts of Iceland and put then in Canada where the North Pole actually is. Maybe. <br /> <br /> I just hope that the Companion has the Toronto Freehold and Courts because I'm still really disappointed that it was removed from the book as it's was far more interesting than any of the courts IN the final book. <br /> <br /> Anyways I sound too negative, the Changeling court has a lot of strengths, I like the Fetch Rules, Hedge Ghosts seem to have more Nuamens, and the seem to be more Dread Powers for other Hobgoblins, which is cool. I know one Contract was improved, the one that allowed to you to reverse time by 10 seconds pure use. Now instead of only being usable once per story, it's usable at will as long as you can pay the cost and it's the automatic reflexive use that saves you from dying that is only once per story. You can now use this contract to save someone else from dying or being caught in a trap, and other cleaver uses. It's really nasty with the Seeming bonuses, moving stealth dots in yards before time restarts (Darklings) and surprise attack (Widen) make it a great combat and defence, life saving power, but the broken things is of you drop the mask you get an exceptional success on it, but you reverse time to before you dropped the mask you will get the 8 again and won't have to drop the mask again, so you don't pay the price or suffer the new gives of doing so. This power is also great against Huntsmen with the Dread Power that allows then to appear in any scene out of nowhere, you can reverse time before the Huntsman appears and feel or set up a trap for it. Easy to fill Loophole too, so often it will only cost 1 willpower. Often worth it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-24T17:04:11-07:00","id":1238419,"title":"","content":"Dude, I think it's pretty clear by now there aren't going to be Toronto courts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-24T17:10:19-07:00","id":1238421,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1238281#post1238281\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Has anyone noticed anything different compared to the manuscript yet, like rule changes?</div> </div> </div> </div>The only changes I've noticed so far is 1) Bedlam now works even if you're not part of the Seasonal Courts, which is a minor but appreciated change, and 2) Dread Powers for hobgoblin now lists every mentioned Dread Power rather than the game assuming you own Chronicles of Darkness.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":8331,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","user":"milo v3","date":". 07-24-2018, 08:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-24T17:34:58-07:00","id":1238424,"title":"","content":"While I am hoping for Contracts for other Court systems in the Companion and stuff, and also more Kiths, I won't hold my breath on the Toronto courts even if they're pretty cool. Although... I mean, I still have the way old 2e playtest doc where Toronto's written up. Personally I'd be satisfied with like, Directional Contracts and maybe some tips on tweaking existing stuff to hit the nonstandard Court systems.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-24T18:11:36-07:00","id":1238437,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1238419#post1238419\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Dude, I think it's pretty clear by now there aren't going to be Toronto courts.</div> </div> </div> </div>Eh? Was this 100% confirmed elsewhere? <br /> <br /> (Not that it matters to me, personally I\u2019ve had my doubts myself on the Toronto Courts being in official material)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-24T18:39:25-07:00","id":1238458,"title":"","content":"Nope, but the sheer faux pas of it all plus a decided silence thus far whenever the subject has come up equals Pretty Damn Obvious.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not be