here's no issue with that, weeks. If there are issues, month or two, maybe?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-02T10:26:20-08:00","id":1278101,"title":"","content":"I received mine on New Years Eve and have been slowly devouring it whenever i have a free moment to indulge in my vice. I *love* the embossing on the cover. So much so, that I can excuse the so-so quality of the paper. I really feel that the pages would have felt and looked better if they were matte instead of glossy. Personal preference, tho. So far, the most striking (non mechanical) difference from 1st Edition is how flowery the prose is. 1st Edition Changeling was pretty spare (for White Wolf games) in regards to the purple prose. I remember a common criticism of 1E was the dryness of the text. Frankly, I prefer the direct and sparse approach ... which is not to impugne the writers at all, it is just a matter of taste.<br /> <br /> But man ... wooo, is this game pretty!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1996-firefly-night","name":"Firefly Night","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"150"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-02T12:06:04-08:00","id":1278115,"title":"","content":"Am I right that the PDF purchase version is waiting for PoD to be finished? <br /> <br /> I--I keep refreshing DriveThruRPG and it... it doesn't change....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12493-khanwulf","name":"Khanwulf","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12493_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"898"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-02T12:14:42-08:00","id":1278120,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Khanwulf</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1278115#post1278115\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Am I right that the PDF purchase version is waiting for PoD to be finished?</div> </div> </div> </div>Pretty much.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-02T17:33:49-08:00","id":1278202,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Firefly Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1158431-changeling-kickstarter-discussion?p=1278101#post1278101\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I received mine on New Years Eve and have been slowly devouring it whenever i have a free moment to indulge in my vice. I *love* the embossing on the cover. So much so, that I can excuse the so-so quality of the paper. I really feel that the pages would have felt and looked better if they were matte instead of glossy. Personal preference, tho. So far, the most striking (non mechanical) difference from 1st Edition is how flowery the prose is. 1st Edition Changeling was pretty spare (for White Wolf games) in regards to the purple prose. I remember a common criticism of 1E was the dryness of the text. Frankly, I prefer the direct and sparse approach ... which is not to impugne the writers at all, it is just a matter of taste.<br /> <br /> But man ... wooo, is this game pretty!</div> </div> </div> </div> I just got mine, and agree about the embossing. That was a nice touch I wasn't expecting and boy does it make the book so beautiful.<br /> <br /> Also, I don't know how I never read the back of the book text, but that's so awesome. &quot;Welcome to once upon right fucking now.&quot; Is one of the coolest phrases I've read in a while and nail the game home enough I'm using it to non CofD players to get them interested.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","v